<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Madito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Madito ga Watumigwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Madito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mad</para>
  <para style="mt1">Madito</para>
  <para style="mt2">ga Watumigwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Madito ga Watumigwa changusima mwaluko wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na ndaze vyochenele kulawila Yelusalemu kuza Yudeya na Samaliya na kuli miji kufungo. Vila Yesu vyoyawalonjele walanguswa wa heye naloyang'hali kuheluka kuza kilanga (Madito 1:8). Nachandichigwa na Lukasi, yuye kahi nayandiche Mbuli Inojile. Nayali dakitali nakwandika chila chinhu goya. Nakamwandichila vitabu vyeng'ha vili, Madito na Mbuli Inojile, Teofili nayawele Mgilichi, ila vitabu avyo kahi na hanji nakagana kuwalangusa vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kwa weng'ha Wagilichi na Wayahudi (Madito 1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Madito hanji nachandichigwa kuli mhela wa makumi sita mbaka makumi sita na gane kulawila Yesu loyavumbuche, kwa vila chitabu nachimala kwandichigwa hala Paoli nayang'hali kulawa mchinweng'ho. Lukasi kahi nayali yenule majendo hamwe na mtumigwa Paoli hanji nakandika chitabu cha Madito kuli muji wa Antiokiya. Madito ndo ulutililo wa Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Lukasi na kwaluka kwa Yesu kuheluka kuza kilanga. Chiwalo cha Lukasi kwandika chitabu cha Madito ndo chichila cha Mbuli Inojile. Nakagana Teofili hamwe na wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, wavizele choni nachowelanguse na kuwandichila chilinguwala mbuli ya ukomu wa Yesu na kwenela kwa makundo ga kumkunda Yesu Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Madito changutulapa hetwe kuvizela mbuli ya chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha mwaluko ng'hatu na ndaze vyotulinguganigwa kikala kuli makundo ga Yesu Kilistu. Ulajilo awu wa watumigwa wangutulajila vila vyotulinguganigwa kikala kwa kitumbila ludali lwa Muhe Yelile kwa kweneza usenga wa Mbuli Inojile kwa wanhu wanji.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Mwaluko Muhe Yelile kanguya kwa walanguswa na chilundo cha wanhu walingukunda Kilistu changukula (Madito 1:1-8).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba chilundo cha walingumkunda Kilistu changugazigwa na kwaluka kwenela kunji Yelusalemu (Madito 8:2-12:23).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kulawa baho Paoli kangwaluka majendo ga mwaluko ga kweneza usenga wa Nguluwi (Madito 12:24-14:28).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Hamba chitala changuting'hana Yelusalemu kupuza choni chilinguganigwa kwa wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wanyale (Madito 15:1-35).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Hamba Paoli kangwinula majendo ga keli kuza kweneza usenga wa Nguluwi (Madito 15:36-18:22).</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kulawila baho, kangwinula majendo ga kadatu ga kweneza usenga wa Nguluwi (Madito 18:23-20:38).</para>
  <para style="io">7. Hamba Paoli kangibatigwa Yelusalemu (Madito 21-26).</para>
  <para style="io">8. Mwiso Paoli kanguhilikwa Loma (Madito 27-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mkulu Teofili kuli chitabu cha heni cha mwaluko nanyandika kuwala mbuli zeng'ha Yesu zoyaditile na kulangusa kulawila mwaluko wa mijito ja heye <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka zuwa lila loyaholigwe kilanga. Kung'hali hanaholigwa kilanga nakawalajiza kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile wala watumigwa loyawahagule. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kwa mhela wa mazuwa makumi gane kulawila hoyabagame nakawalawila mala nyinji kulajila kota ka mkomu. Nawamona, naye nakalongasa na hewo kuwala undewa wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Mhela loyeting'hane na hewo nakawalonjela hino, “Mleche kuka Yelusalemu, ila mbeteze ilagano lyoyawalonjele Mhaza, liwele namnyhulika ndilonga kuwala alyo. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohani nakabatiza kwa mazi, ila logopuluta mazuwa mado, hemwe mobatizigwa kwa Muhe Yelile.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguholigwa kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malichi 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lukasi 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Watumigwa loweting'hane na Yesu, nawamuuza, “Mkulu, ndaze, mhela awu ndo kohilusa undewa kwa Isilaeli?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ila Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mhela wa mbuli azo vya kuli ludali lwa Mhaza wa heni, hambe iwagane kuvizela kota yowa nili. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ila mhela Muhe Yelile hoyowadulichila, mobochela mong'ho na mowa walolezi wa heni kuli Yelusalemu, kuli mkowa wa Yudeya na Samaliya na mbaka kuli kuduma kwa isi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Loyalonjile ago kuno weng'ha womlola, nakaholigwa kilanga, ng'hungugu naimvisa leka waleche kumona kahi.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Lowawele wang'hali wolola kilanga, loyawele yoluta, baho du wanhu weli wawele wavalile nguwo nzelu nawema habehi na hewo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />nawalonga, “Hemwe wanhu wa Galilaya! Ndaze namwima kuno mwangulola kilanga? Yesu yawele nakaholigwa kulawa kwa hemwe kuluta kilanga, kokuya kahi kota hihyo vyommuwene yoluta kilanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiya kanguhaguligwa honhu ha Yudasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matei 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Hamba watumigwa nawahiluka Yelusalemu kulawa kuli chila chidunda chilinguchemigwa chidunda cha Mizeituni, chiwele kota kilomita imwe kulawa kuli muji. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Lowafichile kuli muji nawenjila kuli chihengo cha kuchanya lowawele wochikala, nawo nawali Petili na Yohani na Yakubu na Andeleya na Filipo na Tomasi na Batolomeo na Matei na Yakubu mwana wa Alufayo na Simoni Zelote na Yudasi mwana wa Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Awa weng'ha naweting'hana kumlanda Nguluwi, hamwe na wadala wamwenga na Maliya mayake Yesu na wang'holoze.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Zuwa limwe hamba, Petili nakema hali wala wanhu wawele naweting'hana, weng'ha nawali miya imwe na makumi meli, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />nakalonga, “Wang'holozangu, naiganigwa honhu ha Maandiko Matakatifu henele, honhu hawele Muhe Yelile, kwa ulonzi wa Daudi, nakalavya uloli kuwala mbuli za Yudasi yawele nakawalongoza wala wamibate Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yudasi nayali yumwe wa chilundo cha hetwe, kwa vila nakahaguligwa yawe hamwe kuli mijito ya hetwe.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Heye nakagula mgunda kwa zila sendi zoyazipatile kwa madito ga heye gehile, nakagwa na kutulika lida, vyeng'ha viwele kuli lida lya heye navilawa kunze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Chila munhu kuli Yelusalemu nakahulika mbuli ayo, ahyo kwa ulonzi wa hewo, nawauchema wula mgunda “Hakeli Dama,” ulonzi awu una mana ya, “Mgunda wa danda.” <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Petili nakalutilila kulonga, “Lelo nayandichigwa kuli chitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Honhu ha kikala ha heye hawe mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">munhu yoneche yaleche kikala mgati amo.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kahi nayandichigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Munhu yunji yahole honhu ha heye ha ulongozi.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Lelo, munhu yumwe hali wala welongoze na hetwe mhela weng'ha Yesu loyawele mmajendo hamwe na hetwe yahaguligwe kilumba na hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Ayo kanguganigwa yawe yumwe wa wala welongoze na hetwe kulawila Yohani loyawele yobatiza mbaka zuwa lila Yesu loyaholigwe kulawa kwa hetwe kuluta kilanga. Ayo kowa hamwe na hetwe kulavya ulolezi wa kuzilipuka kwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Aho nawachema matagwa ga wanhu weli, wa mwaluko nayali Yusufu yachemigwe Balisaba ama Yusto na wakeli Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Hamba nawamlanda Nguluwi, “Mkulu hegwe kwanguzizela nhumbula za wanhu weng'ha. Ahyo, utulajilile hali awa weli youmhagule, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />leka yahole honhu ha mijito ja uchitumagwa hoyajilechile Yudasi na kuluta honhu hake yuye.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Nawatowa simbi, simbi naimgwila Matiya, naye nakonjezwa hali wala watumigwa wanji kumi na yumwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Zuwa lya Pendekosti lolifichile, walanguswa weng'ha nawali honhu hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Baho du lizi nalihulikwa kulawa kilanga, liwele kota mbeho ng'hulu, naimemeza yila ng'handa yeng'ha yowawele awo walanguswa. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Hamba navilawa vinhu vilingoneka kota milapi ja chiluli, navisambaluka na kugwa mchanya mwa chila yumwe wa hewo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Weng'ha nawamemezwa Muhe Yelile, nawaluka kulonga ndonga zilivinji kota vila Muhe vyoyawaditile kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ako Yelusalemu nawali Wayahudi, wanhu walingumdumba Nguluwi, walawile kuli chila isi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Lowahuliche lizi alyo, chilundo chikulu cha wanhu nachikungajiza. Weng'ha nawatinhuka lukami kwa vila chila yumwe nakawahulika awo walanguswa wolonga kwa ndonga ya heye. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Wabubuwala kuno wolonga, “Ndaze, awa weng'ha tulinguwahulika wolonga ahi, hawawele wenyeng'haye wa Galilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Naiwa ndaze lelo chila yumwe wa hetwe kanguwahulika wolonga kwa ndonga yake? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamwe wa hetwe ndo Wapaliti na Wamedi na Waelamu na wanji ndo wenyeng'haye wa Mesopotamiya na Yudeya na Kapadokia na Ponto na Asiya <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />na Fulugiya na Pamfiliya na Misili na honhu ha Libiya behi na Kulene, wamwe wa hetwe ndo wajenzi kulawa Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Wayahudi na wanhu wawinzile nzila ya kumfugamila Nguluwi kwa Chiyahudi, wanji nawalawa Kilete na Alabiya. Hetwe tweng'ha twanguwahulika wolonga kwa ndonga za hetwe mbuli ng'hulu za Nguluwi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Weng'ha nawabubuwala kuno wochiuza, “Ayi ina mana yachi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ila wamwe nawawabeza wolonga, “Wanhu awa nawagala divai inyale!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ila Petili nakema hamwe na wala kumi na yumwe nakaluka kuwadamlila wanhu kwa lizi likulu, “Wang'holozangu Wayahudi na weng'ha mlingikala hano Yelusalemu, mhulichize goya ulonzi wa heni. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Wanhu awa hawagalile kota vyomlingijesa, kwa vila sambi ndo saa tatu hela mitondo! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ndikomya, mbuli ayi ndo yila yoyalonjile mloli Yoeli kota,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘Kuli mazuwa gala ga kuduma, Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Ndowapa muhe wa heni wanhu weng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wana wa hemwe wadala na walume wolavya uloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wasekulu wa hemwe wolota kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na wasongolo wa hemwe wowona ulotezi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Mbaka vitumagwa wa heni walume na wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">ndowapa Muhe wa heni kuli mazuwa gala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nawo wolavya uloli.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ndolavya ulajilo kilanga na kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na ulajilo hasi kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kowa na danda na chiluli na iyosi,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />isanya lyowichigwa jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na nyelezi yowa ndung'hu kota danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">kung'hali kuya kwa zuwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">zuwa liwele ndo linojile ng'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ahyo wanhu weng'ha howolanda kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi woloholigwa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Wanhu wa Isilaeli, mhulichize ulonzi awu! Yesu wa Nasaleti nayali munhu yawele nakalajilwa kwa hemwe na Nguluwi kwa vinduzanduza na ulajilo, viwele Nguluwi vyoyaditile hali hemwe kwa kukolela heye, kota vyomvizelele. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kwa kihwana vyoyaganile Nguluwi nakagana kota Yesu yabatigwe na hemwe, namwe namumkopola kwa kuwalechela wanhu wehile wamuwambe. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ila Nguluwi nakamzilipula, kalawa kwa wabagame, nakamlohola kuli usungu wa kubagama kwa vila nahakuganigwe kubagama kumuwohe. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwa vila Daudi nakalonga kuwala heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">“ ‘Nandimona Mkulu kumwando kwa heni mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">ka hamwe na heni kuli ubanzi wa heni wa kudilo si tigasika.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ahyo, nhumbula ya heni naisangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">kahi nanhowa luchenze lwa kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Lukuli lwa heni lochikala kuli kitumbila,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwa vila hambe uileche nhumbula ya heni kuli wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">ne kumkundiza yelile wa hegwe yole.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Nakundajila nzila za ukomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">nakumemeza heni usangalalo kwa kuwa hamwe na hegwe!’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Wang'holozangu, ndangugana kuwalonjela hazelu mbuli zimfichile Daudi, sekulu wa hetwe. Heye nakabagama, nakatiligwa, kahi chilaga cha heye cha baha kwa hetwe mbaka lehano. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ila kwa vila Daudi nayali mloli, nakavizela kota Nguluwi nakamlahila kota komuwika yumwe wa lulelo lwa heye leka yawe mndewa honhu ha heye. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi nakona kung'hali mbuli zoyodita Nguluwi ahyo nakalonga kuwala kuzilipuka kwa Kilistu mhela hoyalonjile, ‘Halechigwe kuli isi ya wabagame, lukuli lwa heye nahalolile.’ <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Lelo, Nguluwi nakamzilipula ayo Yesu natwe tweng'ha twa walolezi wa mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu loyakwinizwe na kuwichigwa na Nguluwi kuli ubanzi wa heye wa kudilo, nakabochela kwa heye Mhaza yula Muhe Yelile yawele nakalagana, nakamdulisa kwa mchanya mwa hetwe ayo Muhe. Acho ndo mlinguchona sambi na kuhulika. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwa vila Daudi, hakwinile mbaka kilanga, ila heye nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">“ ‘Mkulu nakamlonjela Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">wikalise ubanzi wa heni wa kudilo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka ndiwadite wang'honyo wa hegwe wawe chigoda cha kuwichila magulu ga hegwe.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli yanguwalapa kuvizela kota ayo Yesu yowamgazile, ndo yuyula yawele Nguluwi nakamdita yawe Mkulu na Kilistu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Lelo, wanhu lowahuliche ulonzi awu nauwahoma kuli nhumbula za hewo, nawamuuza Petili na wala watumigwa wanji, “Wang'holozetu tudite choni?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petili nakedichila, “Mleche gehile ga hemwe na chila yumwe wa hemwe yabatizigwe kwa itagwa lya Yesu Kilistu leka mpate kulechelwa gehile ga hemwe na kubochela ilagano lya Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwa vila, ilagano lila nalyali kwa chiwalo cha hemwe na kwa chiwalo cha wana wa hemwe na kwa chiwalo cha wanhu weng'ha walingikala kutali na kwa chiwalo cha chila munhu yawele Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe komchema kwa heye.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa ulonzi unji winji, Petili nakawalajiza wanhu yolonga, “Milohole kuli lulelo alu lwihile.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wenji nawaukunda ulonzi wa heye, nawabatizigwa. Wanhu elufu zidatu nawonjezeka kuli chila chilundo zuwa alyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Awa weng'ha walutilila kilangusa kulawa kwa watumigwa, kikala hamwe chilukolo na kumogola ibumunda na kumlanda Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikala kwa chila zuwa kwa wala wanhu wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Vinduzanduza vinji navilajilwa kwa kukolela watumigwa mbaka chila munhu nakadumba. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wanhu weng'ha wa Nguluwi nawalutilila kuwa chinhu chimwe na vinhu vya hewo nawegawila. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Nawali woguza lufufu lwawo na vinhu vyowawele navyo hamba nawegawila sendi kwa kiwhana na vinhu vyoyalinguganigwa kuwa navyo chila yumwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Nawalutilila kiting'hana hamwe chila zuwa kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Ila mhela wa kumogola mibumunda, naweting'hana kuli ng'handa za hewo na nawalya hamwe chilyo acho kwa usangalalo na nhumbula zigoloche. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Nawamtogola Nguluwi, nawaganigwa na wanhu weng'ha. Chila zuwa Mkulu nakawonjezela wanhu kuli chilundo cha hewo wawele nawaloholigwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohani wangumlohola chete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Zuwa limwe, saa tisa nemisi, Petili na Yohani nawali woluta kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi kumlanda Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Lelo nakwali na munhu yawele chete kulawila kupondigwa kwa heye. Chila zuwa nawali womuwika kuli lwizi lwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi lulinguchemigwa Suli leka yalande kwa wanhu walingwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Loyawawene Petili na Yohani wokwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakawalanda wamhe choneche. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petili na Yohani nawamnogolela meho, naye Petili nakamlonjela, “Utulole!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Naye nakawagalamchila kuno yochitumbila hanji kopegwa chinhu. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Aho Petili nakamlonjela, “Ndahela sendi ne zahabu, ila chila chondilinacho ndokupa. Kwa itagwa lya Yesu Kilistu wa Nasaleti, wime na ujende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Hamba nakamibata moko wa kudilo, nakamwinula. Baho du magulu na mafugamilo ga heye nagawa na mong'ho. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nakanyozoka, nakema na kwaluka kujenda. Hamba nakenjila hamwe na hewo kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, yojenda na kunyozoka nyozoka kuno yomtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele aho nawamona yojenda na kumtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Lowavizelele kota ndo yula yaliyolanda hali lwizi Ng'handa ya Nguluwi lulinguchemigwa Suli, nawabubuwala lukami na kulemwela kuvizela gamlawile.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Wanhu weng'ha kuno wawele wabubuwale ng'hatu, nawaluka kubilima woluta honhu halinguchemigwa “Lugagala lwa Solomoni,” hawele yula munhu nayali welongoze na Petili na Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Lelo, Petili loyawawene wanhu awo nakawalonjela, “Hemwe Waisilaeli, lekachoni mwangububuwala kuwala mbuli ayi? Lekachoni mwangutunogolela meho kota ndo kwa ludali lwa hetwe ama welile wa hetwe ndo natumdita munhu ayu yajende?” <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nguluwi wa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakubu, Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hetwe ndo yamtogole chitumagwa wa heye Yesu. Heye ndo yuyula yomumlavile leka yatagusigwe kubagama na kumlema hali Pilato, hanga heye Pilato nayali yamule kumlechela yalute. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Nayali yelile na yanojile, ila hemwe namumlema, namgana munhu yunji yawele yalingukopola yalechelwe yalute. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Lelo, namumkopola yula yawele mwaluko wa ukomu. Ila Nguluwi nakamzilipula, natwe twa walolezi wa mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwa makundo kuli itagwa lya Yesu ndo vimpele mong'ho munhu ayu mlingumona na kumzela. Kwa itagwa lya Yesu na makundo ndo gamlohole munhu ayu kota hemwe weng'ha vyomlingumona.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Lelo, wang'holozangu, ndanguvizela kota namdita ne kuvizela kota vyowaditile vilongozi wa hemwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ila kwa nzila ayi Nguluwi nakeneza chila chiwele nachali yalavile uloli kwa milomo ja waloli wa heye weng'ha kota Kilistu kogazika. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Lelo, mleche gehile ga hemwe na mumgalamchile Nguluwi leka yawosele gehile ga hemwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mdite ahyo leka Mkulu Nguluwi yawape mhela wa kwesela na kuwegalila yula Kilistu yamhagule yawele ndo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Yangumlapa yawe kilanga mbaka houfika mhela wa kuwichigwa goya vinhu vyeng'ha, kota Nguluwi vyoyalonjile kwa kukolela waloli wa heye welile. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kwa vila Musa nakalonga, ‘Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe kowagalilani mloli kota heni kulawa hali hemwe. Yanguwagana kumhulichiza ayo kwa chila mbuli hoyowalonjela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Yoneche yawele homhulichiza mloli ayo kobaguligwa na wanhu wa Nguluwi na kudumigwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Waloli weng'ha, kwaluchila Samweli na wala wamuwinzile, nawadamla mbuli azi ziwele zangukoleka kuli mazuwa aga. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Malagano gala gawele Nguluwi nakagalavya kwa kukolela waloli ndo kwa chiwalo cha hemwe na mwangihanza kuli ilagano liwele Nguluwi nakalidita na wasekulu wa hemwe, kota vyoyamlonjele Abulahamu, ‘Kwa kukolela walelwa wa hegwe, wanhu weng'ha wa kuli isi wotambichizwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Lelo, Nguluwi nakamzilipula chitumagwa wa heye kwa mzidi wa hemwe tandi, nakamlajiza yawagalile utambichizo kwa kumdita chila yumwe wa hemwe yaleche wihe wa heye.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohani wanguhilikwa kuli chitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petili na Yohani lowawele wang'hali wowadamlila wanhu, watambika na chilongozi wa wamizi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi hamwe na Masadukayo nawafika. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Nawazudila lukami, kwa vila awo watumigwa nawali wowadamlila wanhu kota Yesu nakazilipuka, mbuli ilingulajila kota wabagame wozilipuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Lelo, nawawabata, kwa vila nechilo nayali habehi, nawawawika mchinweng'ho mbaka mitondo kwa vila nayali nechilo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ila wenji hali wala wahuliche usenga wa hewo nawakunda, chilundo cha wanhu wakundile nachali chifichile walume elufu zihano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Mitondo, vilongozi wa Wayahudi na wasekulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa naweting'hana hamwe ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Neweting'hana hamwe na Anasi mtambika mkulu na Kayafa na Yohani na Alekizanda na wanji wawele wa lukolo lwa mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Lowawemize Petili na Yohani hali hewo, nawawauza, “Kwa ludali lwa whaani ama kwa itwagwa lya whaani namdita mbuli ayi?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Aho Petili, yawele yamemile Muhe Yelile, nakawalonjela, “Vilongozi na wasekulu wa wanhu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Wone mwangutuuza lehano kuwala yila mbuli inojile yoyaditilwe yula munhu yawele nayali chete na ndaze vyoyawele mkomu, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />lelo, hemwe na wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli mwanguganigwa kuvizela kota munhu ayu kangwima hali hemwe lehano, mkomu ng'hatu, kwa mong'ho wa itagwa lya Yesu wa Nasaleti yawele hemwe namumuwamba, ila Nguluwi nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ayu ndo yula yawele Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Iganga lyomlilemile hemwe mlinguzenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">lelo naliwa iganga likulu lya msisi.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ulohozi wahaduhu kwa munhu yunji yoneche, kwa vila kuli isi yeng'ha, wanhu hawapegwe itagwa munhu yunji yawele hetwe twanguweza kuloholigwa naye.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Awo vilongozi na wasekulu wa chitala, nawali wovizela kota Petili na Yohani nawali wanhu wawele hawasomile, nawabubuwala kuwala vyowalonjile goya. Nawavizela kota nawali welumbile na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ila lowamuwene yula munhu yosilwe utamwa yemile hamwe na hewo, hawalonjile chinhu. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ahyo, nawawalonjela walawe hali chitala, nawo nawapona mng'handa wolongasa chinyele. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Naweuza, “Tudite choni na wanhu awa? Chila munhu yalingikala Yelusalemu kanguvizela kota ulajilo awu wakububuwaza naukoleka, natwe hatubela mbuli ayi. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ila wone twangugana kulemeza mbuli ayi ileche kwenela ng'hatu kwa wanhu, tuwalemeze leka waleche kulonga na munhu yoneche kwa itagwa lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ahyo nawawachema kahi mng'handa, nawawalemeza waleche kulonga kahi hazelu, ne kulangusa kwa itagwa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ila Petili na Yohani nawawedichila, “Mwamule mwemwe wone inoga hali Nguluwi kuwahulichiza hemwe kusinda kumhulichiza Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwa vila hatuleka kulonga kuwala mbuli zila zotuziwene na kuzihulika.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Lelo, awo wasekulu wa chitala nawawalemeza kwa kung'hang'hala ng'hatu, hamba nawawalechela welejehe. Hawawagazile kwa vila wanhu weng'ha nawali womtogola Nguluwi kwa mbuli ayo ilawile. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Ayo munhu yoselwe utamwa nayali na miyaka makumi gane.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawele na makundo wangumlanda Nguluwi yawemize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Baho du lowalechigwe welejehe, Petili na Yohani nawahiluka kwa wayawo, nawawalonjela gala gowalonjelwe na watambika wakulu na wasekulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nawo lowahuliche mbuli azo nawelumba na wayawo kumlanda Nguluwi wolonga, “Mkulu, hegwe ndo ulumbile ulanga na isi na bahali na vyeng'ha viwele amo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Hegwe nakulonga kwa Muhe Yelile kwa kukolela mlomo wa mhaza wa hetwe Daudi, chitumagwa wa hegwe, nakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Lekachoni wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wanguwa na ivuche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Lekachoni wanhu wangijesa kubelenhuka?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Wandewa wa isi nawewika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na vilongozi naweting'hana hamwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">leka kumlema Mkulu Nguluwi na Kilistu.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ndikomya, kwa vila Helodi na Pontio Pilato hamwe na wanhu wa isi zinji na Waisilaeli, loweting'hane hano kuli muji, kumlemela Yesu chitumagwa wa hegwe Yelile yawele nakumuwika chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ena, naweting'hana leka wadite mbuli zila zouganile zilawile kulawa mwaluko kwa ludali na igano lya hegwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Lelo, gwa Mkulu, ulole kukabusa kwa hewo. Ututanze hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe kudamla ulonzi wa hegwe ne kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Golola moko wa hegwe leka uwalohole wanhu. Udite ulajilo na vinduzanduza kwa itagwa lya Yesu Chitumagwa wa hegwe Yelile.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Lowasindile kumlanda Nguluwi, hala honhu howawele naweting'hana nahatigaswa, nawo weng'ha nawamemezwa Muhe Yelile. Weng'ha nawaluka kudamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi ne kudumba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawele na makundo wangihanza vinhu vya hewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Weng'ha wawele na makundo nawali na nhumbula ziwhanile na kunuwila kumwe. Haduhu ne yumwe yawele na chinhu yachiwiche chiwe cha heye yeka, ila nawegawila vyeng'ha vyowawele navyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Watumigwa nawalavya ulolezi wa kuzilipuka kwa Mkulu Yesu kwa mong'ho ng'hatu na Nguluwi kawatambichiza weng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Haduhu munhu yoneche yawele nakesilwa chinhu, kwa vila wawele na migunda ama ng'handa nawali woguza <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kuwapa watumigwa sendi azo, nazigawilwa kwa chila yumwe kwa kiwhana na vyoyalinguganigwa kupegwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Nakwali na Mlawi wa lukolo lwa Kupulo, itagwa lyake Yusufu, yawele watumigwa nawamchema Balinaba, izeleche kota, “Munhu yalinguwakangaza nhumbula wanhu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Heye naye nayali na mgunda, nakauguza, nakahola zila sendi nakawapa watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Ananiya na mche wa heye Safila nawaguza mgunda wa hewo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ila mche wa Ananiya nakavizela kota Ananiya nakavisa chasi cha sendi choyapatile na chasi chiyage nakawapa watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Lelo, Petili nakamuuza, “Ananiya, lekachoni Limazoga nalinjila kuli nhumbula ya hegwe na kukudita umuhade Muhe Yelile kwa kuvisa honhu ha sendi zoupatile kwa kuguza mgunda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Kung'hali kuuguza nawali wa hegwe na louguzile awo mgunda azo sendi nazali za hegwe ukolele chougana. Lekachoni nakwamula kudita mbuli ayi? Haumuhadile munhu, nakumuhada Nguluwi!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiya loyahuliche ago, nakagwa hasi, nakabagama. Wanhu weng'ha lowahuliche mbuli ayo nawadumba lukami. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wasongolo nawoya, nawaugubika mtufi wa heye, nawaulavya hanze, nawautila.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Logamalile masaa gadatu hino, mchewake ne kuvizela mbuli ilawile, nakenjila mla mng'handa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petili nakamlonjela, “Ndonjele! Ndaze, chasi achi cha sendi ndo chompatile kwa kuguza ula mgunda?” Heye nakamwidichila, “Ena ndo zizo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Aho Petili nakamlonjela, “Lekachoni namikundiza kumhada Muhe wa Mkulu Nguluwi? Uhulichize! Wala wanhu walutile kumtila mlume wa hegwe, sambi wa kuli lwizi na hegwe nagwe wokuhola kahi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Baho du Safila nakagwa hali magulu ga Petili, nakabagama. Wala wasongolo lowenjile, nawamfika yabagame, ahyo nawamlavya mgati, nawamtila habehi na mlume wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Kudumba kukulu nakuchifika chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi na wanhu weng'ha wahuliche mbuli ayo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wangudita vinduzanduza vinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Watumigwa nawadita vinduzanduza vinji hali wanhu. Walingumkunda Nguluwi nawali wochiting'hana kuli lugagala lwa Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Munhu yoneche yawele hamkundile Nguluwi helumbile na hewo hanga wanhu wanji wawele hela makundo ago nawawatogola. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Wanhu wamkundile Mkulu Nguluwi wawele ndo walume na wadala nawonjezeka. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Mbaka wanhu nawali wowagala watamwa mnzila na kuwawasiliza mchanya mwa vinhanda na nhemvu leka Petili hoyokola, isisila lya heye likole hali hewo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Wanhu wenji nawoya kulawa kuli miji ja hafungo ha Yelusalemu, nawawagala watamwa wa hewo na wawele na vijeni, nawo weng'ha nawoselwa matamwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wangugazigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Hamba, mtambika mkulu na wayage wawele wa chilundo cha Masadukayo wa honhu aho, nawawonela maya watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Lelo, nawawabata watumigwa na kuwahindila mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ila nechilo mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakachumula lwizi ja chinweng'ho, nakawalavya kunze, nakawalonjela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mlute na kwima kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi mkawalonjele wanhu ulonzi weng'ha wa ukomu awu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Watumigwa nawakunda, nawenjila kuli ng'hada ya Nguluwi kung'hali lufuku, nawaluka kulangusa. Mtambika mkulu na wayage lowafichile, nawachema Nhing'hano ng'hulu na wakulu weng'ha wa utaguso na vilongozi wa Wayahudi, hamba nawawalajiza wanhu kuli chinweng'ho leka wakawegale wala watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ila awo vitumagwa lowafichile ako hawawafichile mla mchinweng'ho. Ahyo nawahiluka, nawahiluka na kuwalonjela mbuli ayo kuli nhing'hano, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />wolonga, “Natujifika lwizi ja chinweng'ho jihindigwe chila ubanzi na wamizi wololela lwizi ajo. Ila lotuchumule nahatumfichile munhu yoneche mla mng'handa.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Chilongozi wa wamizi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na watambika wakulu lowahuliche mbuli ayo nawafichigwa na lunhwinhwi, hawavizelele gawafichile. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Nakoya munhu yumwe, nakawalonjela, “Wala wanhu womuhindile mchinhweng'ho, sambi wa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, wanguwalangusa wanhu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Aho chilongozi wa wamizi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi hamwe na wanhu wa heye nawaluta kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakawegala. Ila hawawabate kwa lupichi, kwa vila nawadumba wanhu wowatowa na maganga.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Lelo, nawawegala, nawawemiza hali Chitala. Mtambika mkulu nakawalonjela, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Natuwalemeza ng'hatu kulangusa kwa itagwa lya munhu ayu, lelo namdita malanguso ga hemwe genele kuli Yelusalemu yeng'ha na mwangunuwila kutuwichila nongwa ya kubagama kwa munhu ayu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Aho Petili, yawele hamwe na wala watumigwa wanji, nakedichila, “Yanguganigwa tumhulichize Nguluwi, haiwele wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nguluwi wa wasekulu hetwe nakamzilipula Yesu kulawa kwa wabagame, yawele hemwe namumkopola kwa kumuwamba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ayu ndo yula yatogoligwe na Nguluwi, nakamuwika kuli ubanzi wa heye wa kudilo, nakawa chilongozi na Mlohozi, leka yawadite wanhu wa Isilaeli waleche gehile ga hewo, leka walechelwe gehile ga hewo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Hetwe twa walolezi wa mbuli ayo, naye Muhe Yelile yawele Nguluwi nakawapa wala walingumuhulichiza, kangulavya ulolezi wa mbuli ayo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Vilongozi weng'ha wa chitala lowahuliche ago nawazudila, mbaka nawagana kuwakopola watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ila Mfalisayo yumwe yalinguchemigwa Gamalieli yawele nayali mlangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na yalinguhulichizwa ng'hatu hali wanhu weng'ha, nakema hali Chitala, nakagana wala watumigwa walavigwe kunze kwa mhela uchefu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Hamba nakawalonjela wala vilongozi wa Chitala, “Hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, mijese ng'hatu chomlingugana kuwadita wanhu awa! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Katali hado, nakwali na munhu yumwe itagwa lya Teuda, nakedaya kota heye ndo munhu yatanganiche na wanhu miya zine nawelumba na heye. Ila nakakopoligwa, hamba wala wamuwinzile nawasambaluka na chilundo cha heye nachaga. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kahi, hamba, mhela wula wa kuwazigwa wanhu, nakwali na Yudasi wa Galilaya. Naye nakawakwega wanhu nawo nawamuwinza, ila naye kahi nakakopoligwa na wala wamuwinzile nawasambaluka. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Sambi ndanguwalonjela, mleche kuwaditila wanhu awa chinhu choneche, muwaleche! Kwa vila, wone mbuli ayi ama mijito ja hewo najaluchizwa na munhu, jokwaga jiliyeka. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ila wone nayaluchizwa na Nguluwi, haiwele kota molemwa kuwasumya hela, ila mochifika mwangumlema Nguluwi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Lelo, nawekundiza na heye. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Ahyo nawawachema wala watumigwa, nawamula watowigwe ng'hobwa na kuwalemeza waleche kulangusa kwa itagwa lya Yesu, hamba nawawaleka walute. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Lelo, watumigwa nawalawa hanze ha Chitala kuno wasangalale, kwa vila nawaganigwa kubasigwa soni kwa itagwa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Nawalutilila chila zuwa kulangusa na kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya Kilistu kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuli ng'handa za wanhu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Watanzi saba wa watumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Hamba, walanguswa lowawele wokonjezeka, nakwali na kung'ung'uta hali wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi walingulonga Chigilichi na wala walingulonga Chiebulaniya. Wala walingulonga Chigilichi nawang'hung'huta kota wanhu wa hewo wawele nawafililwa na walume wa hewo nawali wosemigwa kuli kugawilwa vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupegwa chila zuwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ahyo, watumigwa kumi na weli nawawachema walanguswa weng'ha, nawalonga, “Hainojile hetwe tuleche kudamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi leka tukole mijito ja kuwagawila wanhu vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupegwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ahyo, wang'holozetu, mhagule hali hemwe wanhu saba watanganiche, wawele na Muhe Yelile na luhala, wawele towapa mijito ajo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Natwe tokola mijito ja kumlanda Nguluwi na kudamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Mbuli ayo naiwanojeza wanhu weng'ha walingumkunda Nguluwi. Nawawahagula Stefani, munhu yawele na makundo makulu na yawele na Muhe Yelile hamwe na Filipo na Pilokolo na Nikanoli na Timoni na Palimena na Nikolao wa Antiokiya yawele mhela umwe nayali yofugama kwa Chiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Nawawawika hali watumigwa, nawo watumigwa nawalanda kwa chiwalo cha hewo na kuwawichila moko kumutwi kwa hewo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ulonzi wa Nguluwi naulutilila kwenela na wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu nawonjezeka ng'hatu na chilundo chikulu cha watambika nawabochela makundo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani kangubatigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Nguluwi nakamha Stefani kunoga kwinji na ludali mbaka nayali yodita vinduzanduza hali wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ila wanhu wamwenga nawetwanza na Stefani. Wamwe wa wanhu awo nawali wa sunagogi limwe lichemigwe, “Sunagogi lya Wanhu Welejehe,” nawo nawalawa Kulene na Alekisandilia, wanji nawalawa Kilikiya na Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ila nawalemwela kumsumya kwa chiwalo cha luhala lwake na Muhe Yelile yamlongoze mhela loyalonjile. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ahyo nawawalonjela wanhu wamwenga kwa uviso walonje, “Natumhulika Stefano yolonga ulonzi wa kumliga Musa na Nguluwi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa chiwalo acho, nawawadita wanhu na wasekulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa wazudile. Nawo nawamibata Stefani, nawamigala hali chitala. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Nawawegala walolezi wa udesi hali chitala wawele nawalonga, “Munhu ayu hambe yaleche kulonga ulonzi wa kuhaliga honhu aha helile na malajizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwa vila natumhulika yolonga kota Yesu wa Nasaleti kohawifya ng'hatu honhu helile na kugalula vihendo vyeng'ha vyotupegwe na Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele kuli chitala nawamnogolela meho Stefani, nawona kumeho kwa heye kuwele kota mhilisi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Stefani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Lelo, mtambika mkulu nakamuuza Stefani, “Ndaze! Mbuli azi ndo zakukomya?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Stefani nakedichila, “Wang'holozangu na wahaza wa heni, mnyhulichize! Nguluwi nakamlawila sekulu wa hetwe Abulahamu loyawele yochikala Mesopotamiya kung'hali hanaluta kikala Halani, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nguluwi nakamlonjela, ‘Uche kuli isi ya hegwe, uwaleche wanhu wa lukolo lwa hegwe, ulute kuli isi yondikulajila.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ahyo, Abulahamu nakoka kuli isi ya Wakalidayo, nakaluta kikala Halani. Loyabagame mhaza wa heye, Nguluwi nakamusa Halani na kumigala kuli isi ayi yomlingikala sambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nguluwi hampele ne honhu hamwe ha isi ayi leka hawe ha heye, ahyo, nakalagana na heye kota komha isi ayi iwe ya heye na ya walelwa wa heye, hanga mhela awo hawele na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nguluwi nakamlonjela hino, ‘Walelwa wa hegwe wohilikwa kuli isi ilingulongozwa na wanhu wanji, ako woditigwa wapogozi na kuditilwa vibi kwa mhela wa miyaka miya zine. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ila ndowatagusa wanhu wa isi ayo wawele wowadita wapogozi. Hamba ndowalavya kuli isi ayo leka woye wafugamile heni honhu aha.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Hamba Nguluwi nakadita ilagano na heye liwele ndo kwinjila ikumbi awo ndo ulajilo wa heye. Ahyo, Abulahamu nakamwinjiza ikumbi mwanage Isaka kuli zuwa lya nane kulawa kupondigwa. Isaka naye nakadita hihyo, nakamwinjiza ikumbi Yakubu. Naye Yakubu nakawenjiza ikumbi wanage kumi na weli wawele ndo wasekulu wa hetwe.”<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Wala wasekulu wa hetwe nawamonela fihi Yusufu mng'holozawo, nawamguza kuli upogozi Misili. Ila Nguluwi nayali hamwe na heye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />nakamlohola kuli magazo ga heye geng'ha. Nguluwi nakamha heye igano lya kwimilila na luhala hali Falao, mndewa wa Misili, mbaka Falao nakamuwika yawe chilongozi wa yila isi na ng'handa ya chiundewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Hamba, nakwali lufemba kuli isi yeng'ha ya Misili na Kanani, nalwambuza kugaya kukulu. Wasekulu wa hetwe hawawezile kupata chilyo choneche. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Lelo, Yakubu loyahuliche mbuli kota ako Misili nakwali na chilyo, nakawalajiza wanage, wawele ndo wasekulu wa hetwe, walute ako Misili, nawaluta. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Lowalutile lwa keli, Yusufu nakezelesa kwa wang'holoze na Falao, mndewa wa Misili, nakazeleswa wang'holoze Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yusufu nakawalajiza wanhu wamigale Yakubu, mhaza wa heye hamwe na lukolo lwa heye lweng'ha, weng'ha nawali wanhu makumi saba na wahano, woye Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ahyo, Yakubu nakaluta Misili kuwele heye na wanage wawele ndo wasekulu wa hetwe nawabagama. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mitufi ja hewo najigaligwa mbaka Shekemu, najitiligwa kuli chilaga chiguligwe na Abulahamu kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Hamoli kwa chasi chimwenga cha sendi.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Mhela louwele habehi kufika wa lila ilagano liwele Nguluwi nakamha Abulahamu, wanhu nawalutilila konjezeka lukami ako Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Hamba, mndewa yumwe yawele hamzelele Yusufu nakaluka kulongoza ako Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Nakawaditila vibi wanhu wa hetwe na kuwagaza wasekulu wa hetwe na kuwadita wawataje wana wawele vyali leka wabagame.” <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa nakapondigwa mhela awo. Nayali mwana yanojile ng'hatu. Nakaloligwa kuli ng'handa ya mhaza wa heye kwa miyezi jidatu <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />na loyalavigwe kunze, mhiza wa Falao nakamhola, nakamlolela kota mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa nakalanguswa mbuli zeng'ha za luhala lwa Wamisili, nayali yazidahe kwa ulonzi na madito.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Loyawele na miyaka makumi gane nakamula kuluta kuwalola wang'holoze Waisilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ako nakamona yumwe wa hewo yoditilwa vibi na Mmisili, nakaluta kumgombola na kwa kuhilula chibida nakamkopola yula munhu. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa nakejesa kota Waisilaeli wayage wahavizelele kota Nguluwi kanguwalohola kwa kukolela heye, ila nahawavizelele. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Zuwa liwinzile, Musa nakawona Waisilaeli weli wochitwanza, nakajeza kuwahanyisa yolonga, ‘Hemwe mwa lukolo, lekachoni lelo mwangiditila vibi mwemwe yeka?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Yula yawele yomtowa myage nakamkundujiza Musa hafungo yolonga, ‘Whaani yakuwichile hegwe uwe chilongozi na yalingwamula hali hetwe? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ndaze, kwangugana kung'hopola kota vyoumkopole yula Mmisili mitondo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Loyahuliche ago, Musa nakadwina, nakaluta kikala kuli isi ya Midiani, ako nakawa na wana weli.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Miyaka makumi gane lojifichile, mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila Musa kuli chisosolo chilingwaka chiluli kula kugunuche behi na chidunda cha Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa loyaiwene mbuli ayo nakabubuwala ng'hatu, loyahejele habehi leka yalole, nakahulika lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Heni nda Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hegwe wawele ndo Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakubu.’ Musa nakakakama kwa lunhwinhwi na hajezile kulola. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, ‘uvule makwamba ga hegwe, kwa vila honhu houkwima ndo honhu helile. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nandigona gehile gowalinguditilwa wanhu wa heni kula Misili. Nanyhulika kulila kwa hewo, nani nambuya kuwalohola. Lelo, ndokulajiza Misili.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Ayu Musa ndo yula wanhu wa Isilaeli nawamlema lowalonjile, ‘Whaani yakuwichile hegwe uwe chilongozi na yalingwamula hali hetwe?’ Kwa kukolela yula mhilisi yamlawile kuli chila chisosolo chiwele chilingwaka chiluli, Nguluwi nakamlajiza ayo Musa yawe chilongozi na mgombozi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Nakawalongoza wana wa Isilaeli kulawa Misili, loyaditile ulajilo na vinduzanduza vinji ako Misili, kuli bahali ya Shamu na kugunuche kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa ndo yawalonjele wanhu wa Isilaeli, ‘Nguluwi kowahagulila mloli kota heni hali wang'holozenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Waisilaeli lowekungajize kula kugunuche, Musa ndo nayali kota msenga hali awo wasekulu wa hetwe na yula mhilisi yawele nakalongasa naye kuli chidunda cha Sinai. Ndo yapegwe wula ulonzi wa ukomu leka yatupe hetwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Ila wahaza wa hetwe nawalema kumhulichiza Musa, nawamlema na kugana kuhiluka Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nawamlonjela Aluni, ‘Tugongomanyile milungu jiwele jotulongoza mnzila, kwa vila hatuvizelele gamfichile ayo Musa yatulongoze kulawa Misili!’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Aho ndo nawegongomanyila limalukolo lya ilogota, nawalavya nhambiko na kudita mvina kuli chinhu chiwele ndo mijito ja moko ga hewo wawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ila Nguluwi nakoka hali hewo, nakawaleka wafugamile nhondwe za kilanga, kota voyandichigwe kuli chitabu cha waloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Hemwe Waisilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Ndaze, kwa miyaka makumi gane kula kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">namingalila nhambiko na ndolendole ne kamwe?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Hemwe namchipika chibumuli cha mlungu Moloki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na limalukolo lya nhondwe lya mlungu wa hemwe Lefani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Vinhu viwele namvigongomanya mwemwe leka mvifugamile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Ahyo ndowahilika hemwe kuli isi ya chijenzi, kutali kusinda Babiloni!’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Kula kugunuche wasekulu wa hetwe nawali na lila Ihema lya Nguluwi. Nalyali ligongomanywe kota Nguluwi navyoyamlonjele Musa yalidite, kwa kiwhana na chila choyalajilwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Hamba wasekulu wa hetwe nawebocheleza lila Ihema lya Nguluwi, mbaka mhela wa, Lowaiholile yila isi kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi wawele Nguluwi nakawawinga hali hewo. Aho naliwa baho mbaka mhela wa Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi nakaganigwa lukami na Nguluwi, nakamlanda Nguluwi yamkundize leka yamzenjele ng'handa Nguluwi wa Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ila Solomoni ndo yamzenjele Nguluwi ng'handa.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Ila, Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya hambe yekale kuli ng'handa zizenjigwe na wanhu, kota mloli vyoyalingulonga,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“ ‘Mkulu kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">kilanga ndo chigoda cha heni cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na isi ndo chigoda cha heni cha kuwichila magulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Lelo, ng'handa ilindaze yomuweza kunzenjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:50">na honhu hachi hondikwesela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:50">Ndaze, vinhu avi vyeng'ha sividitile heni?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Hamba Stefani nakalutilila kulonga, “Hemwe wajuvi! Nhumbula za hemwe na makutu ga hemwe ndo kota ga wanhu wa isi. Hemwe ndo kota wasekulu wa hemwe. Mazuwa geng'ha mwangumlema Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ndaze, hana mloli wa Nguluwi yoneche yawele wasekulu wa hemwe hawamgazile? Nawawakopola awo wawele Nguluwi nakawalajiza wadamle kuya kwa heye Yawele na Hachi. Lelo, namwe namumbelenhuka, namumkopola. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Hemwe namgabochela malajizo gagaligwe kwa hemwe na mhilisi, ila hamugakundile.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani kangukopoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wala wasekulu wa Chitala lowahuliche ago, nawazudila ng'hatu, nawajejeda mizino kwa kuzudila. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ila Stefani yawele yamemile Muhe Yelile, nakalola kilanga, nakawona ukulu wa Nguluwi na Yesu yemile ubanzi wa kudilo wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Nakalonga, “Mlole! Ndangona ulanga ugubuligwe na Mwana wa munhu yemile ubanzi wa kudilo wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Aho, wanhu weng'ha wawele kuli Chitala, nawatowa iyowe na kudinya makutu ga hewo kwa moko gawo. Hamba weng'ha nawamnyozochela, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />nawamlavya hanze ha muji, nawamtowa na maganga. Wala walolezi nawajiwika mikoti ja hewo hali ulolezi wa msongolo yumwe yalinguchemigwa Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Nawalutilila kumtowa Stefani na maganga kuno yomlanda Nguluwi, “Mkulu Yesu, ubochele Muhe wa heni!”<figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Munhu yalingutowigwa na maganga mbaka kubagama</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Nakafugama, nakalila kwa lizi likulu, “Mkulu, uwosele gehile aga.” Loyalonjile ago, nakabagama.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Naye Saulo nayali yakundile kota Stefani kanguganigwa kubagama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi changwaluka kugazigwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Zuwa alyo chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu nachaluka kugazigwa ng'hatu. Wanhu weng'ha walingumkunda Nguluwi naiwagana kusambaluka kuli honhu ha migunda ja Yudeya na Samaliya, ila haiwele watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wanhu walingumdumba Nguluwi nawamtila Stefani na kulombocheza ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Mhela wuwo Saulo nakajeza kuchiwifya chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Nguluwi. Nakaluta kuli chila ng'handa, nakawalavya mgati walingumkunda Nguluwi, walume na wadala, nakawawika mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walingumkunda Nguluwi wangudamla Mbuli Inojile ako Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Wala walingumkunda Nguluwi wasambaluche, nawaluta chila honhu kuno wodamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Naye Filipo nakenjila kuli muji wa Samaliya, nakadamla mbuli za Kilistu kwa wenyeng'haye wa aho. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Wanhu lowamhuliche Filipo na kona ulajilo na vinduzanduza vyoyaditile, nawahulichiza goya gala goyalonjile. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Kwa vila vijeni viwele navinjila kwa wanhu navilawa kuno vitowa iyowe likulu na wanhu wenji wawele nawazilika na vyete nawaloholigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Nakwali na usangalalo ukulu kuli muji wula.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Lelo nakwali na munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Simoni yawele nayali yaditile uhawi kwa mhela winji kuli muji awo yowabubuwaza wanhu weng'ha wa Samaliya. Nakedaya kota heye ndo munhu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Wanhu weng'ha, wadodo na wakulu, nawamhulichiza goya, wolonga, “Munhu ayu ndo ludali lwa mlungu lulinguchemigwa ‘Ludali Lukulu.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Nawamuwinza kwa vila nayali yawabubuwaze kwa uhawi wa heye kwa mhela winji. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ila lowaukundile usenga wa Filipo kuwala Mbuli Inojile ya undewa wa Nguluwi na itagwa lya Yesu Kilistu, nawabatizigwa, wadala na walume. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni naye nakakunda, loyasindile kubatizigwa nayali yochilongoza na Filipo, nakabubuwala kwa ulajilo wa vinduzanduza viwele vikoleka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wala watumigwa wawele kula Yelusalemu lowahuliche kota wenyeng'haye wa Samaliya nawo nawaubochela ulonzi wa Nguluwi, nawawalajiza ako Petili na Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Lowafichile Samaliya, nawalanda kwa chiwalo cha walingumkunda Nguluwi leka wambochele Muhe Yelile, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwa vila mhela awo Muhe Yelile nayali hamdulichile munhu yoneche hali hewo, ila nawabatizigwa hela kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Lelo, Petili na Yohani wawawichila moko awo wamkundile Nguluwi, nawo wambochela Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Aho Simoni nakavizela kota kwa kuwichilwa moko ga watumigwa, walingumkunda Nguluwi nawapegwa Muhe Yelile. Ahyo nakawapa sendi Petili na Yohani yolonga, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Mumhe nani ludali alo leka yoneche yondimuwichila moko, yabochele Muhe Yelile.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ila Petili nakamwidichila, “Udumigwe hegwe hamwe na sendi za hegwe, kwa vila kwangijesa kota kwanguweza kugula ludali lwa Nguluwi kwa sendi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Kwahela honhu honeche ne hachi kuli mijito ajo kwa vila Nhumbula ya hegwe haiwele goya hali meho ga Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ahyo, ulonje gehile ga hegwe hali Mkulu Nguluwi na umlande heye hanji koweza kukulechela kwa chiwalo cha majesa ago. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwa vila ndangukona kota nakumema maya na kwa mchinweng'ho cha gehile!” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni nakedichila, “Mlande kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha heni, leka ago gomlonjile galeche kufika kwa heni.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petili na Yohani lowasindile kulavya ulolezi wa hewo na kudamla usenga wa Mkulu Nguluwi, nawahiluka Yelusalemu. Lowawele wohiluka nawadamla Mbuli Inojile kuli vijiji vinji vya Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo kangumbatiza mng'hangala yumwe wa Etiopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Filipo, “Wiwiche goya ulute kusini kwa kukolela nzila ilingulawila Yelusalemu kuluta Gasa.” Nzila ayo yangukolela kugunuche. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Lelo, Filipo nakewika goya, nakaluka majendo. Mhela wuwo nakwali na munhu yumwe towashi wa Etiopiya, yawele nayali kuli majendo ga kuluta kaye kwa heye. Ayo munhu nayali chilongozi mkulu yawele na ludali kuli ng'hano za Kandake, mndewa wa chidala wa Etiopiya. Nayali yalutile ako Yelusalemu kumlanda Nguluwi na mhela awo nayali yohiluka yawele yakwinile mutuka wa kukwejigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Loyawele mnzila yohiluka, nayali yochisoma chitabu cha mloli Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Lelo, Muhe Yelile nakamlonjela Filipo, “Ulute habehi na mutuka awo leka milongoze.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo nakabilimila habehi na mutuka, nakamhulika ayo munhu yosoma chitabu cha mloli Isaya. Filipo nakamuuza, “Ndaze, kwangugazela ago goulingugasoma?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ayo munhu nakamwidichila, “Ndovizela ndaze wone haduhu munhu wa kundongoza?” Aho nakamchema Filipo yakwine kuli mutuka, yekalise hamwe na heye. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Lelo, honhu ha Maandiko Matakatifu hoyawele yosoma nayali ahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Nayali kota ing'holo lilinguhilikwa kudumuligwa singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">tulu kota vila lyana ing'holo holidumuligwa milaika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">heye halavile lizi ne hado.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kuli kubasigwa soni kwa heye hapegwe ne hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Haduhu yoweza kulonga kuwala lulelo lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwa vila ukomu wa heye nawusigwa kuli isi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ayo Mwetiopiya nakamlonjela Filipo, “Ndonjele, ayu mloli kangulonga kuwala choni? Kangulonga mbuli azi kuwala heye yuye ama kuwala munhu yunji?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Lelo, Filipo nakaluchila honhu ha ago Maandiko Matakatifu, nakamlonjela Mbuli Inojile kuwala Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Lowawele wolutilila na majendo, nawafika honhu hawele na mazi, ayo chilongozi nakalonga, “Honhu aha hana mazi, ndaze, hana chinhu choneche chilingundemeza kubatizigwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo nakamlonjela, “Wone kwangukunda kwa nhumbula ya hegwe yeng'ha kwanguweza kubatizigwa.” Naye nakedichila, “Ena, ndangukunda kota Yesu Kilistu ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Lelo, ayo chilongozi nakalajiza wula mutuka wime, weng'ha weli Filipo na yula chilongozi nawedulika kuli mazi, naye Filipo nakambatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Lowalawile kuli mazi Muhe wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamdita Filipo yajilile. Ayo chilongozi hamuwene kahi, ila heye nakalutilila na majendo ga heye kuno yawele yasangalale.<figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8:39">Munhu yalingubatizigwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo nakefika yawele Asoto, nakakola kuli miji jeng'ha kuno yodamla Mbuli Inojile mbaka hoyafichile Kaisaleya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kanguleka gehile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Madito 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mhela awo Sauli nayali yokangaza kukabusa kwa kuwakopola walanguswa wa Mkulu Nguluwi. Nakaluta kwa mtambika mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nakalanda yapegwe baluwa ya kuzeleswa kuli masunagogi kula Damasiko, leka hoyowafika ako walume ama wadala walinguwinza nzila ayo, yawabate na kuwagala Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ila loyawele mnzila habehi kufika Damasiko, baho du lumuli kulawa kilanga nalumwemwesa nzingo zeng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Nakagwa hasi na kuhulika lizi limlonjela, “Sauli, Sauli! Lekachoni kwangungaza?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Naye Sauli nakauza, “Kwa whaani hegwe, Mkulu?” Lila lizi nalidichila, “Nda Yesu, yawele ulingumgaza. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ila wime lelo, winjile kuli muji, ako kolonjelwa choulinguganigwa kudita.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wala wanhu wawele nawali kuli majendo hamwe na Sauli nawema ne kuwa na ulonzi, nawahulika lizi ila hawamuwene munhu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli nakenuka, loyagubule meho ga heye hawezile kona choneche, ahyo wala wanhu nawamlongoza kwa kumibata moko mbaka Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli nakekala mazuwa gadatu ne kona, mhela awo hadile ne kunwa chinhu choneche.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Lelo, ako Damasiko nakwali na mlanguswa yalinguchemigwa Ananiya. Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela kuli kulota, “Ananiya!” Ananiya nakedichila, “Nda hano Mkulu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Wiwiche goya ulute kuli nzila ilinguchemigwa igoloche, kuli ng'handa ya Yudasi umlande munhu yumwe yalawile Talso yalinguchemigwa Saulo. Sambi kangumlanda Nguluwi, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />kuli kulota nakamona munhu yalinguchemigwa Ananiya yokwinjila mng'handa na kangumuwichila moko leka yalole kahi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ila Ananiya nakedichila, “Mkulu, nanyhulika mbuli za munhu ayu kulawa kwa wanhu wenji kuwala gehile goyawaditile wanhu wa hegwe ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nakoya hano Damasiko yawele na ludali kulawa kwa watambika wakulu leka yawabate wanhu weng'ha walingulanda kwa itagwa lya hegwe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Hegwe lute, kwa vila nandimhagula heye leka yawe chitumagwa wa heni, yalidamle itagwa lya heni kwa wanhu wa isi zinji na wandewa wa hewo na kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nani ndomlajila ndaze vyoyalinguganigwa kugazika kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Lelo, Ananiya nakaluta, nakenjila kuli ayo ng'handa loyawele Sauli. Nakamuwichila moko kumutwi, nakalonga, “Gwa, Sauli, Mkulu yawele ndo Yesu yawele nakakulawila louwele mnzila kuya hano, nakandajiza leka kwa hegwe leka upate kona kahi na umemezwe Muhe Yelile.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Baho du vinhu kota mibadu navigwa kulawa kuli meho ga Sauli, nakaluka kulola kahi. Nakema, nakabatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Loyasindile kulya chilyo, mong'ho wa heye nauhiluka kwa heye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli kangudamla ako Damasiko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli nakekala mazuwa machefu hamwe na walanguswa ako Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Baho du nakaluka kudamla kuli masunagogi kota Yesu ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wanhu weng'ha wamhuliche nawabubuwala, nawalonga, “Ndaze, munhu ayu hawele yawakopole wala walingulanda kwa itagwa lili kula Yelusalemu? Kahi nakoya hano kwa mbuli ya kuwebata wanhu awo na kuwegala kwa watambika wakulu!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Sauli nakonjezeka kuwa na ludali na kuwadita Wayahudi walingikala Damasiko wabubuwale kwa kutawiza kota Yesu ndo Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Logapulute mazuwa menji, Wayahudi nawekungajiza na kiwika goya mbuli ya kumkopola Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ila Sauli nakahulika mbuli ayo. Wayahudi nawali wokwamila lwizi jeng'ha ja muji, nechilo na nemisi leka wamkopole. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ila mhela wa nechilo walanguswa wa heye nawamhola, nawamdulisa yawele mgati mwa izandu kwa kukolela kuli lukanzi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kanguhiluka Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli loyafichile Yelusalemu nakajeza kilumba na wala walanguswa. Ila weng'ha nawamdumba kwa vila hawakundile kota naye nayali mlanguswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Aho, Balinaba nakamhola Sauli, nakamigala kwa watumigwa na kuwalonjela Saulo vyoyamuwene Mkulu mnzila na ndaze Mkulu vyoyalongase naye. Kahi nakawalonjela vila Saulo vyoyadamle kwa itagwa lya Yesu ne kudumba kula Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ahyo Sauli nakekala na hewo kuno yojenda kwa kilejeha chila honhu ako Yelusalemu, yodamla kwa itagwa lya Yesu ne kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Nakadawala na kitwanza na Wayahudi walingulonga Chigilichi, ila hewo nawajeza kumkopola. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Wala wayage lowavizelele mbuli ayo, nawamhola Sauli, nawamhilika kuli muji wa Kaisaleya na kumdita yalute Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Mhela awo chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu nachali na kikala goya kuli honhu heng'ha ha Yudeya na Galilaya na Samaliya. Nachali na mong'ho na kwa uhembulizo wa Muhe Yelile nachonjezeka na kulutilila kumdumba Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ainea kanguloholigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petili loyawele kuli majendo ga kuluta chila honhu, nakafika kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi wawele wochikala Luda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ako nakamfika munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Ainea yawele yawasile kuli chinhanda kwa mhela wa miyaka nane kwa vila nayali yaziliche. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Lelo, Petili nakamlonjela, “Ainea, Yesu Kilistu kangukulohola. Winuche uwiche goya chinhanda cha hegwe.” Baho du Ainea nakenuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wenyeng'haye weng'ha wa Luda na Saloni lowamuwene Ainea yojenda nawamgalamchila Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dolikasi kanguloholigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Nakwali na mlanguswa yumwe mdala kuli muji wa Yopa yalinguchemigwa Tabita kwa Chigilichi ndo Dolikasi, iwele na mana ya Chifuno. Ayo mdala nayali yodita ganojile na kuwatanza wazunwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mhela awo nakatamika, nakabagama. Wanhu nawauhovuga mtufi wake, nawauwasiliza kuli chihengo cha kuchanya. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Muji wa Yopa hauwele kutali ng'hatu na Luda, ahyo walanguswa lowahuliche kota Petili nayali Luda, wawalajiza wanhu weli walute kwa heye kuno wawele na usenga, “Uye kwa hetwe himahima.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Lelo, Petili nakaluta hamwe na hewo. Loyafichile nakahilikwa kuli chila chihengo. Ako wafililwe na walume wa hewo wawele ndo wenji nawamzunguluta Petili wolila na kumlajila mikoti na mivalo jiwele Dolikasi nayali yajigongomanye kwa chiwalo cha hewo mhela loyawele mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petili kawalavya kunze weng'ha, hamba nakafugama nakamlanda Nguluwi. Hamba nakaugalamchila wula mtufi, nakalonga, “Tabita, winuche.” Nakagubula meho ga heye, loyamuwene Petili, nakekalisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petili nakamtanza kwima, hamba nakawachema wala wanhu wa Nguluwi na wala wafililwe na walume wa hewo, nakamigala kwa hewo yawele mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Mbuli ayo nayenela chila honhu ako Yopa na wanhu wenji nawamkunda Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petili nekekala mazuwa menji ako Yopa kwa munhu yumwe yalingugongomanya ngozi yalinguchemigwa Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Kolineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kuli miji wa Kaisaliya nakwali na munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Kolinelio, yawele nayali chilongozi wa chilundo chilinguchemigwa Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Heye hamwe na wanhu wa ng'handa ya heye nawali womdumba Nguluwi, nayali yowatanza wazunwa na kumlanda Nguluwi mazuwa gose. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Zuwa limwe saa tisa matinazo, nakapata uloli, nakamona mhilisi yokuya kwa heye na kumlonjela, “Kolinelio!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolinelio nakamlola ng'hatu kuno yodumba, nakamlonjela, “Hana choni Mkulu?” Ayo mhilisi nakamlonjela, “Nguluwi nakabochela kulanda kwa hegwe na ndolendole za hegwe kwa wazunwa na kuwa ukumbuchilo kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Lelo walajize wanhu Yopa leka wamcheme munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Simoni, kwa itagwa linji Petili. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Heye kamng'handa ya Simoni yalingugongomanya ngozi yawele ng'handa ya heye ya hafungo ha Bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yula mhilisi loyochile, Kolinelio nakawachema vitumagwa wa heye weli hamwe na mwamizi yawele yomdumba Nguluwi yawele hali wala walingumkolela mijito, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />nakawalonjela mbuli zeng'ha zilawile hamba nakawalajiza walute Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Mitondo nemisi, awo wanhu wadatu lowawele habehi kufika kuli muji wa Yopa, Petili nakakwina kuli chinduwiko cha ng'handa leka yalande. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Loyawele yolanda, nayali na nzala, nakagana kupata chilyo. Ila wowawele wowika goya chilyo, heye nakawasa ng'hatu na kulota. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Nakona ulanga ugubuligwe na chinhu kota igolole likulu lyanguduliswa kuno liwele libatigwe kuli mhembo zake zine. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mgati mwa alyo igolole nakwali na chila igongolo liwele na magulu gane na vilumbigwe vilingutambala na videje. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Nakahulika lizi limlonjela, “Petili, winuche, udumule singo na ulye!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petili nakedichila, “Hebu, Mkulu, heni sinajeza chinhu choneche chiwele chikokomoche ama chiwele mlongo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Lila lizi nalihulikwa kahi lwa keli, nalimlonjela, “Uleche kuvichema vikokomoka vinhu viwele Nguluwi nakavyeliza!” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Mbuli ayi naikoleka mala zidatu, hamba lila igolole nalihiluswa kilanga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petili loyawele yang'hali yabubuwale kuwala wula ulajilo woyauwene, wala wanhu wawele nawalajizwa na Kolinelio, nawaifichila yila ng'handa ya Simoni yalingugongomanya ngozi, nawema hali lwizi. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Nawahodiza na kuuza kota Simoni yalinguchemigwa Petili nayali yochikala aho.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Mhela Petili yawele yochijesa kuwala wula ulajilo, Muhe Yelile nakamlonjela, “Simoni, hana wanhu wadatu wangukupala. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Uduliche himahima na uleche kudumba kuluta na hewo kwa vila heni ndo ndiwalajize.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Lelo, Petili nakadulika, nakawalonjela awo wanhu, “Heni ndo yula mlingumpala. Lekachoni namuya?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Hewo nawamwidichila, “Natulajizwa na Kolinelio yawele chilongozi wa wamizi. Heye ka yanojile na yalingumdumba Nguluwi na yalinguhulichizwa na Wayahudi weng'ha. Heye nakalonjelwa na mhilisi yelile yakulaliche kaye kwa heye leka yahulichize ulonzi woumlonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petili nakawalonjela wenjile mng'handa, nakawapa honhu ha kuwasa nechilo yila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Mitondo, Petili nakaluka majendo hamwe na hewo, wamwe wa wanhu wa ako Yopa nawelongoza na heye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Zuwa lya keli nawafika Kaisaliya naye Kolinelio nayali yowabeteza yawele na ivyazi lya heye na goloko wa heye yawalaliche. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petili loyawele yokwinjila, Kolinelio nakalawa kumbochela, nakafugama hali heye na kinamiza mbaka hasi. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ila Petili nakamwinula, nakamlonjela, “Wime, kwa vila heni nda munhu hela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petili nakalutilila kulongasa na Kolinelio, kuno wokwinjila mng'handa muwele nakawafika wanhu wenji wekungajize. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Petili nakawalonjela, “Hemwe mwanguvizela kota Myahudi yoneche nakalemezwa na malajizo ga nzila ya heye ya kumfugamila Nguluwi kilumba na wanhu wa isi zinji. Ila Nguluwi nakandajiza ndeche kumjesa munhu yoneche kota kakokomoka ama ka wavu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Kwa chiwalo acho, lomnyhemile nambuya ne kijesa. Lelo, ndanguwauza, lekachoni namnyhema?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolinelio nakalonga, “Mazuwa gadatu gapulute mhela kota awu wa matinazo, saa tisa, nandali ndimlanda Nguluwi kuchihengo cha heni. Baho du! Munhu yawele yavalile mivalo jilingupulika nakema kumwando kwa heni, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />nakalonga, ‘Kolinelio! Kulanda kwa hegwe na ndolendole za hegwe kwa wazunwa nazikundigwa na Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Mlajize munhu yalute Yopa yakamcheme munhu yalinguchemigwa Simoni, kwa itagwa linji Petili, ka kuli ng'handa ya Simoni yalingugongomanya ngozi habehi na bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ahyo nandikugalila usenga ne kukawila, nagwe nakudita goya kuya. Lelo, hetwe twa kumwando kwa Nguluwi, kuhulichiza choneche chila chiwele Mkulu nakakulajiza kulonga.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudamla kwa Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Aho Petili nakaluka kulonga, “Ndikomya, lelo nandivizela kota Nguluwi hambe yabagule. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Munhu wa isi yoneche yalingumdumba Nguluwi na kudita gawele ga hachi kangukundigwa na heye. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Awu ndo wula usenga wa Nguluwi woyauhiliche kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli, yodamla Mbuli Inojile ilingigala kikala goya kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu yawele ndo Mkulu wa wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Hemwe mwanguizela mbuli ilawile kuli isi yeng'ha ya Wayahudi kwaluchila Galilaya kulawila hala Yohani vyoyadamle kuwala Ubatizo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mwangumzela Yesu wa Nasaleti na vila Nguluwi vyoyambakalize mafuta na kumha Muhe Yelile na mong'ho, heye nakaluta aku na ako yodita ganojile na kuwalohola weng'ha wawele hali ludali lwa Limazoga kwa vila Nguluwi nayali hamwe na heye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Hetwe twa walolezi wa mbuli zeng'ha zoyaditile kuli isi ya Yudeya na muji wa Yelusalemu. Nawamkopola kwa kumuwamba, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />ila Nguluwi nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame zuwa lya kadatu, nakamdita yoneche, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />haiwele kwa wanhu weng'ha, ila kwa wala wawele Nguluwi nakawahagula wawe walolezi wa heye, kwa vila hetwe natulya na kunwa hamwe na heye hala loyazilipuche. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Nakatulajiza tudamle Mbuli Inojile kwa wanhu weng'ha na kulavya ulolezi kota heye ndo yabakalizwe mafuta na Nguluwi yawe mtagusa wa wakomu na wabagame. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Waloli weng'ha, nawalonga kuwala heye kota chila munhu kokusilwa gehile ga heye geng'ha kwa itagwa lya heye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolineli na ivyazi lyake wangumbochela Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Mhela Petili loyawele yolonga ulonzi awo, Muhe Yelile nakawadulichila weng'ha wawele nawali wohulichiza usenga awo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wala Wayahudi wamkundile Kilistu wawele nawoya hamwe na Petili kulawa Yopa nawabubuwala kwa kona kota Nguluwi nakawajidila Muhe Yelile wanhu wa isi zinji, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />kwa vila nawawahulika wolonga kwa ndonga zilivinji womtogola Nguluwi. Aho Petili nakalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Wanhu awa nawambochela Muhe Yelile kota hetwe vyotumbochele. Ndaze, hana yoneche yawele yoweza kudita waleche kubatizigwa kwa mazi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Lelo, nakalajiza wabatizigwe kwa itagwa lya Yesu Kilistu. Hamba nawamlanda Petili yekale hamwe na hewo kwa mazuwa mado.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Petili kwa walingumkunda Kilistu ako Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Watumigwa na wanhu wamkundile Kilistu wawele Yudeya nawahulika kota wanhu isi zinji nawo nawaubochela ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Lelo, Petili loyahiluche Yelusalemu, wala Wayahudi wakundile wawele nawagana wanhu wanji wenjile ikumbi, nawamng'ung'utila wolonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Hegwe nakuluta kikala na wanhu wawele hawenjile ikumbi na kulya hamwe na hewo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Aho Petili nakawalonjela ne kuvisa kuwala mbuli zeng'ha zilawile ako kulawila mwaluko.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Zuwa limwe londiwele ndimlanda Nguluwi ako kuli muji wa Yopa, nambona uloli, nambona chinhu kota igolole likulu lyanguduliswa kulawa kilanga liwele libatigwe kuli mhembo zeng'ha zine, naliwichigwa hafungo ha heni. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nasunjilila mgati mwa lila igolole nambona migongolo jiwele na magulu gane, migongolo ja kisolo na vilumbigwe vilingutambala na videje vya kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Hamba nanyhulika lizi lindonjela, ‘Petili winuche, udumule singo, ulye.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ila heni nandonga, ‘Hebu Mkulu, kwa vila choneche chiwele nachikokomoka na mzilo kwa heni hachijezile kwinjila kuli mlomo wa heni.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Lila lizi nalilonga kulawa kilanga lwa keli, ‘Uleche kuchichema chikokomoche chinhu choneche chiwele Nguluwi nakacheliza.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Mbuli ayo naikoleka mala zidatu, hamba vyeng'ha navihiluswa kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Baho du, wanhu wadatu nawalajizwa kwa heni kulawa Kaisaliya, nawafika kuli ng'handa yondiwele ndikala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muhe naundonjela ndute hamwe na hewo ndeche kijesa. Awa wang'holozangu sita natulutasa hamwe Kaisaliya na ako natwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Kolineli. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Heye nakatulonjela vyoyamuwene mhilisi yemile mng'handa ya heye na kumlonjela, ‘Mlajize munhu Yopa yakamcheme munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Simoni, kwa itagwa linji Petili. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Heye kokulonjela ulonzi uwele hegwe na wang'holozo weng'ha wowadita mloholigwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Lonyhaluche kulonga, Muhe Yelile nakadulika kwa hewo kota vyoyatudulichile hetwe hala mwaluko. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Aho nang'humbuchila wula ulonzi uwele Mkulu woyalonjile, ‘Yohani nakabatiza kwa mazi, ila hemwe mobatizigwa kwa Muhe Yelile.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Lelo, wone Nguluwi nakawapa utambichizo wuwula wanhu wa isi nzinji kota woyatupele hetwe hala lotumkundile Mkulu Yesu Kilistu, ndaze, heni nda whaani mbaka ndimbeze Nguluwi?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Lowahuliche ago, nawaleka kitwanza, nawamtogola Nguluwi wolonga, “Nguluwi nakawapa wanhu wa isi zinji mhumu ya kumgalamchila Nguluwi leka wapegwe ukomu.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilundo cha walingumkunda Kilistu ako Antiokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Lelo wala wasambaluche kwa chiwalo cha magazo galawile na kubagama kwa Stefani, nawaluka majendo mbaka Foinike na Kupulo na Antiokiya. Nawo nawadamla wula usenga wa Nguluwi kwa Wayahudi hela. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ila wamwe wa hewo nawali wanhu wa Kupulo na Kulene, lowalutile Antiokiya nawaudamla awo usenga kwa wanhu wa isi zinji wowadamlila Mbuli Inojile ya Mkulu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mkulu nakawatanza na wanhu wenji nawakunda na kumgalamchila Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Mbuli ayo naihulikwa na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Yelusalemu. Ahyo nawamlajiza Balinaba yalute Antiokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Loyafichile ako nakona vila Nguluwi vyoyawonele isungu wala wanhu, nakasangalala na kuwalonjela weng'ha wekale kwa kitumbila kwa Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba nayali munhu yawele yanojile na yamemile Muhe Yelile na yawele na makundo. Chilundo chikulu cha wanhu nachikwejigwa kwa Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Hamba, Balinaba nakaluta Taliso kumpala Saulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Loyamuwene, nakamigala Antiokiya. Nawo weng'ha weli nawekala na chila chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kwa mhela wa mwaka umwe kuno wolangusa chilundo chikulu cha wanhu. Ako Antiokiya, ndo kwa mwaluko walanguswa nawachemigwa Wakilistu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mhela wuwo waloli nawoya Antiokiya kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Lelo, yumwe wa hewo yalinguchemigwa Agabo nakema, kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile nakalavya uloli kota kowa na lufemba kuli isi yeng'ha. Lufemba alo nalulawila mhela wa ulongozi wa Kilaudiyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wala walanguswa nawamula chila munhu yegale choyawelenacho leka kuwatanza wala wanhu walingikala ako Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Lelo, nawadita ahyo na kumha Balinaba na Saulo vyeng'ha viwele navikungajizwa leka wavigale hewo wawo kwa vilongozi wa wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu changugazigwa lukami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mhela wuwo, mndewa Helodi nakaluka kuwagaza wanhu wamwe walingumkunda Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Nakamkopola Yakubu mng'holoze Yohani kwa ipanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Loyawene kota mbuli ayo naiwanojeza Wayahudi, nakalutilila, nakamibata Petili. Mbuli ayo naikoleka mhela wa mvina ya mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Loyabatigwe, Petili nakawichigwa mchinweng'ho, nakawichigwa hali ulolezi wa vilundo vine vya wamizi, viwele na wamizi wane kuli chila chilundo. Helodi nakanuwila kumlavya hali wanhu loimala mvina ya Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Lelo, Petili loyawele mchinweng'ho, chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu nachali chilanda ng'hatu kwa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhilisi kangumlavya Petili mchinweng'ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Nechilo, kung'hali zuwa liwele Helodi nayali yanuwile kumlavya na kumlonjeleza, Petili nayali yawasile hagati ha wamizi weli, yawele yawohigwe kwa minyololo mili. Nawo wamizi nawali wokwamila kuli lwizi lwa chinweng'ho. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Baho du, mhilisi wa Mkulu nakema habehi na lumuli nalulangaza kuli chila chihengo cha chinweng'ho. Mhilisi nakamdoliza Petili mlubavu na kumdita yalilimche, nakamlonjela, “Uche himahima!” Baho du jila minyololo joyawohigwe mmoko najidumka na kulagala hanyi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mhilisi nakamlonjela, “Wiwohe isali lyako, uvale makwamba gako.” Nakadita hihyo. Hamba mhilisi ayo nakamlonjela, “Uvale ikoti lyako, umbinze.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petili nakamuwinza kunze ila nahavizelele kota ago gaditigwe na ayo mhilisi nagali ga kukomya, nakejesa kota nayali yolota. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Nawakola honhu ha mwaluko ha wamizi na ha keli, hamba nawafika kuli lwizi lwa chuma lwa kwinjila kuli muji. Alo lwizi nawichumula uliyeka, nawo walawa kunze. Nawali wojenda kuli nzila imwe na baho du yula mhilisi nakamleka Petili yaliyeka.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Aho ndo Petili nakavizela galawile, nakalonga, “Ndikomya, lelo ndanguvizela kota Mkulu nakamlajiza mhilisi wa heye nakandohola kuli moko ga Helode na kulawa kuli mbuli zila zeng'ha ziwele wanhu wa Isilaeli nawazibeteza.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Loyavizelele mbuli ayo, nakaluta mbaka haluga ha Maliya mayake Yohani yalinguchemigwa Malichi. Amo nakwali na wanhu wenji wawele wekungajize womlanda Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petili nakahodiza kuli lwizi lwa kunze na chitumagwa yumwe mhinza yalinguchemigwa Loda, nakaluta kuli lwizi. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Loyavizele kota nalyali lizi lya Petili, nakasangalala ng'hatu, nakahiluka ne kuchumula lwizi na kuwalonjela kota Petili ka kuli lwizi. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Nawamlonjela yula mhinza, “Kuna lukwale!” Ila heye nakemilila kota nakakomya. Nawo nawamlonjela, “Ayo ndo mhilisi wa heye.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Mhela awo Petili nayali yolutilila kuhodiza. Hamba nawachumula lwizi, nawamona Petili, nawabubuwala. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petili nakawagololela moko wanyamalile, nakawasimila vila Mkulu vyoyamlavile mchinweng'ho. Hamba nakawalonjela wamlonjele Yakubu mbuli ayo na wala wanhu wanji, hamba nakoka nakaluta honhu hanji.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Lokubwemwenzuche, nakwali na lunhwinhwi ng'hatu hali wala wamizi kuwala gala gamfichile Petili. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode nakalajiza wampale ila hawamuwene. Lelo nakalajiza wala wamizi wauzigwe, nakalavya mzilo wakopoligwe. Hamba Petili nakalawa ako Yudeya nakaluta Kaisaliya kuwele nakekala.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Helodi nakezudizwa ng'hatu na wanhu wa Tilo na Sidoni. Ila hewo nawawahilika wasenga kwa heye. Nawo nawampata Bilasto yawe ubanzi wa hewo. Bilasto nayali chilongozi wa walingwamila ng'handa ya mndewa. Hamba, nawaluta kwa Helodi kumlanda kuwe na kikala goya, kwa vila isi ya hewo naitumbila isi ya mndewa ayo kwa chilyo.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Zuwa limwe lihaguligwe, Helodi yawele yavalile ivalo lya chiundewa nayali yekalise kuli chigoda cha undewa, nakadamla kwa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Wala wanhu wawele wekungajize nawatowa iyowe lya kusangalala wolonga, “Ali lizi ndo lya mlungu, haliwele lya munhu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Baho du mhilisi wa Mkulu nakamgwisa Helodi kwa vila nahamtogole Nguluwi. Minhu najimulya, nakabagama. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ulonzi wa Nguluwi nalulutilila kwenela.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balinaba na Sauli lowasindile jila mijito ja hewo jiwele najiwahilika, nawahiluka kahi Yelusalemu kuno wawele hamwe na Yohani yalinguchemigwa Malichi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli wanguhaguligwa na kulajizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Kuli chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Antiokiya nakwali na wanhu wamwe wawele waloli na walangusa, hali hewo nayali Balinaba na Simoni yachemigwe Mtitu na Lukio wa Kilene na Sauli na Manaeni yawele nakaloligwa hamwe na mndewa Helode. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Lowawele womlanda Mkulu Nguluwi na kwesela kulya, Muhe Yelile nakalonga, “Muwahagule Balinaba na Sauli kwa chiwalo cha mijito jondiwachemele.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Lelo, lowasindile kumlanda Nguluwi na kwesela kulya, nawawawichila moko kumutwi na kuwaleka walute.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli wanguluta Kupilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Lelo, Banaba na Saulo lowalajizwe na Muhe Yelile, nawaluta mbaka Seleukia kuwele nawakwina meli mbaka kuli chihilwa cha Kupilo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Lowafichile Salami nawadamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi kuli Masunagogi ya Wayahudi. Yohani nayali yowatanza.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Lowakolile kuli chihilwa cheng'ha, nawafika kuli muji wa Pafo, ako nawamfika Myahudi yumwe yawele mhawi yalinguchemigwa Bali-yesu kwa chigilichi ndo Elima, yawele nakedita mloli. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Munhu ayo nayali hamwe na Seligio Paoli, munhu yawele na luhala yawele chilongozi wa chila chihilwa. Seligio Paoli nakawachema Balinaba na Sauli leka yahulichize ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ila yula mhawi Elima kota vyoyawele yochemigwa kwa Chigilichi, nakajeza kitwanza na Balinaba na Sauli leka yamlemeze ayo chilongozi wa chihilwa yaleche kuukunda ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Lelo, Sauli yachemigwe Paoli, yawele yamemile Muhe Yelile, nakamnogolela meho ayo mhawi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />nakalonga, “Kwa mdesi ng'hatu na mhadi hegwe! Hegwe kwa mwana wa Limazoga! Hegwe kwa mng'honyo wa choneche chiwele cha kukomya, hambe uleche kwajiliza nzila za Mkulu zigoloche. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Lelo, moko wa Mkulu wokuzapa. Kowa hambe ulole na huweza kona lumuli lwa isanya kwa mhela uchefu.” Baho du ikunguyosi na jiza navimgubika, naye nakaluta aku na kula yompala munhu wa kumibata moko leka yamlajile nzila. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yula chilongozi wa chihilwa loyagawene ago, nakakunda kwa vila nakabubuwazwa na malanguso kuwala Mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli kuli muji wa Antiokiya Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kulawa Pafo, Paoli na wayage nawakwina meli nawaluta mbaka Peliga ako Pamfuliya, ila Yohani nakawaleka, kahiluka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ila hewo nawalutilila na majendo kulawa Peliga mbaka kuli muji wa Antiokiya uwele Pisidia. Zuwa lya Kwesela nawenjila mgati mwa sunagogi, nawekalisa.<verse eid="ACT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Lowasindile kusoma chitabu cha malajizo ga Musa na maandiko ga waloli, vilongozi wa sunagogi nawawahilichila usenga awu, “Wang'holozangu, wone mwanayo mbuli ya kuwalonjela wanhu leka kuwakangaza nhumbula mlonje.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Lelo, Paoli nakema, nakalavya ulajilo kwa moko, nakaluka kulonga. “Wanhu wa Isilaeli na wanhu wanji weng'ha mlingumdumba Nguluwi, mhulichize! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nguluwi wa wanhu awa wa Isilaeli nakawahagula wasekulu wa hetwe, nakawadita wanhu awa wawe wanhu wa isi ng'hulu lowawele kuli isi ya chijenzi kula Misili. Nguluwi nakawalavya ako kwa ludali lwa heye lukulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane nakemilila madito gawo lowawele kula kugunuche. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Nakawadumya wanhu wa isi saba wawele nawali wochikala kuli isi ya Kaanani, nakawapa Waisilaeli isi ayo leka iwe ya hewo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Miyaka miya zine na makumi gahano najipuluta, hamba nakawapa watagusa wawalongoze mbaka mhela wa mloli Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Aho nawagana wawe na mndewa, Nguluwi nakawapa Sauli, mwana wa Kishi wa nhanzi ya Benjamini, yawe mndewa wa hewo kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Loyamusile Sauli, Nguluwi nakamhagula Daudi yawe mndewa wa hewo. Nguluwi nakalajila igano kwa Daudi yolonga, ‘Nandimona Daudi mwana wa Yese, ndo munhu yalingihanyisa na nhumbula ya heni, munhu yawele kokweneza gala geng'ha gondilingugana kudita.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Daudi, Nguluwi, nakawagalila Waisilaeli Mlohozi, yawele ndo Yesu kota vyoyalagane. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kung'hali kuya kwa Yesu, Yohani nakadamla kwa wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli kota wanguganigwa kulonga gehile ga hewo na kubatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohani loyawele yokweneza mijito jake nakalonga, ‘Mwangijesa kota heni nda whaani? Siwele yula yomlingumbeteza. Ayo yalinguya kunyhalila nani sijeza kudohola ne ng'weso za makwamba ga heye.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Wang'holozangu, lukolo lwa Abulahamu, na wanhu wanji weng'ha mlingumdumba Nguluwi, usenga awu wa ulohozi naugaligwa kwa hemwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwa vila wenyeng'haye wa Yelusalemu na vilongozi wa hewo hawamzelele Yesu kota mlohozi ne kuuzela ulonzi wa waloli uwele ngulonjigwa kuli chila Zuwa lya Kwesela. Ahyo, nawaudita ulonzi wa waloli wenele kwa kumtagusa Yesu yabagame. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Hanga hawamuwene na nongwa ilingumgana yabagame, nawamlanda Pilato yamtaguse yabagame. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Lowasindile kweneza geng'ha gawele gandichigwe kuwala heye, nawamdulisa kulawa kuli msalaba, nawamtila kuli chilaga. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ila Nguluwi nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Naye kwa mazuwa menji, nakawalawila wawele nawali hamwe na heye kwaluchila Galilaya mbaka Yelusalemu. Kulawila mhela wula wanhu awo ndo walolezi wa heye hali wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Natwe natuya hano kuwagalila Mbuli Inojile, mbuli yila iwele Nguluwi yoyalagane na wasekulu wa hetwe kowegalila, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />nakeneza lelo kwa chiwalo cha hetwe wazukulu wa hewo kwa kumzilipula Yesu kulawa kwa wabagame. Kota vyoyandichigwe kuli Zabuli ya keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘Hegwe kwa mwana wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">heni lehano ndiwa mhaza wa hegwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kwa vila Nguluwi nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame yaleche kola, lelo, Nguluwi nakalonga ahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">“ ‘Ndokupa utambichizo welile na wakukomya wondimlonjele Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ena na kuli honhu hanji ha Zabuli hangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">“ ‘Humleka Yelile wa hegwe yole.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Lelo, Daudi, nakeneza gala goyalingugana Nguluwi kuli mhela wa heye, hamba nakabagama na kutiligwa habehi na wasekulu wa heye na mtufi wa heye nawola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ila yula yawele Nguluwi nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame naholile. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Ahyo wang'holozangu, ndagugana mvizele kota kwa kukolela ayo Yesu, kulechelwa kwa gehile ga hemwe kwanguwikuligwa <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na chila munhu yalingumkunda Yesu kangulechelwa gehile geng'ha, mbuli iwele hanayalikoleka kwa nzila ya malajizo. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Lelo milolele leka mleche kufichigwa na gala gowalonjile waloli.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“ ‘Mlole hemwe mlingubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">mbubuwale leka mwajilile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwa vila ndodita chinhu lomuwa mng'hali wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hanga mwahalonjelwe, hamwalikunda!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paoli na Balinaba lowawele wolawa kuli lila sunagogi, wala wanhu nawawalalika woye kahi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela liwinzile leka walongase goya kuwala mbuli azo. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Nhing'hano ayo loimalile, Wayahudi wenji na wanhu wanji wa isi zinji wawele wanguwinza dini ya Chiyahudi nawawawinza Paoli na Balinaba. Awo watumigwa nawalongasa nawo na kuwakangaza nhumbula leka walutilile kikala kwa kitumbila igano lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Zuwa lya Kwesela liwinzile, wanhu wenji kuli wula muji nawoya kuhulichiza ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ila Wayahudi lowachiwene chila chilundo cha wanhu nawona maya, nawetwanza na Paoli kwa kulema ulonzi woyalonjile na kumliga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ahyo, Paoli na Balinaba nawalonga kwa ludadali ng'hatu, wolonga, “Naitugana kwaluka kulonga na hemwe ulonzi wa Nguluwi, ila kwa vila namuulema, namitagusa mwemwe kota hambe mganigwe kupegwa ukomu wa mazuwa gose, lelo twanguwagalamchila wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakatulajiza hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘Nandiwawika hemwe muwe lumuli lwa wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">leka muwegalile wanhu ulohozi kuli isi yeng'ha.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Wanhu wa isi zinji lowahuliche mbuli ayo nawasangalala, nawautogola usenga wa Mkulu Nguluwi na wala wawele nawahaguligwa kubochela ukomu wa mazuwa gose, nawakunda.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nawenela chila honhu kuli honhu hala. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ila Wayahudi nawawadita wadala walingumfugamila Nguluwi, wawele vilongozi na walume wanji watanganiche wa mji wula wawagaze. Nawaluka kuwagaza Paoli na Balinaba na kuwawinga. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Lelo, watumigwa nawakung'huna nhimbwisi kuli magulu gawo kota upanjilo, hamba nawaluta Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ila awo walanguswa nawali wamemile usangalalo na Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paoli na Balinaba ako Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Kula Ikonio, mbuli nazali kota vyoziwele kula Antiokiya, Paoli na Balinaba nawaluta kuli sunagogi lya Wayahudi na kudamla goya mbaka Wayahudi wenji na Wagilichi nawakunda. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ila Wayahudi wanji wawele nawalema kukunda, nawazidita nhumbula za wanhu wa isi zinji ziwe zihile leka wetwanze na wang'holozawo wawele nawakunda. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Paoli na Balinaba nawalutilila kikala ako mhela winji. Nawadamla goya kuwala Mkulu, naye Mkulu nakatawiza kukomya kwa usenga wowaulavile kuwala igano lya heye kwa kuwadita wadite ulajilo na vinduzanduza. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ila wanhu wa muji awo nawali kuli banzi mbili, wanji nawelumba na Wayahudi na wamwe nawelumba na watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Hamba, wanhu wa isi zinji na Wayahudi nawelumba na vilongozi wamwe, nawewika goya kuwaditila vibi watumigwa na kuwatowa na maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Watumigwa lowavizelele mbuli ayo, nawabilimila Lustila na Delibe, Miji ja Lukaonia na honhu hanji ha habehi. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Ako nawalutilila kudamla Mbuli Inojile.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli na Balinaba ako Lustila na Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Nakwali na munhu yumwe ako Lustila yawele chete kulawa kupondigwa kwa heye, nahawahiche kujenda nehado. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Munhu ayo nayali yomhulichiza Paoli loyawele yodamla. Paoli loyamlolile goya nakona kota kana makundo ga kuloholigwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Wime kwa magulu gako!” Ayo munhu nakema na kwaluka kujenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Chilundo cha wanhu vyochiwene choyaditile Paoli, nachaluka kutowa iyowe kwa ndonga ya Chilukaonia, “Milungu najuya kwa hetwe kwa kiwhana na wanhu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Balinaba nawamchema Seusi na Paoli nawamchema Helime, kwa vila heye ndo nayali yolonga. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mtambika wa ng'handa ya mlungu Seusi iwele hanze ha muji, nakegala mibuguma na nganda za uluwa hali lwizi lwa muji kwa vila heye na chila chilundo cha wanhu nawagana kuwalavila nhambiko awo watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Balinaba na Paoli lowahuliche mbuli ayo, nawadeganga mivalo ja hewo na kubilimila kuli chila chilundo cha wanhu, kuno wotowa iyowe wolonga, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Hemwe wanhu, lekachoni mwangudita mbuli azi? Hetwe twa wanhu kota mwemwe. Twahano kuwadamlila Mbuli Inojile leka mjileche aji jimalukolo, mumgalamchile Nguluwi yawele mkomu, Nguluwi yawele nakalumba ulanga na isi na bahali na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele amo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Katali Nguluwi nakawaleka wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wadite kota vila vyowaganile. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ila halechile kilajila kwa wanhu. Nakalajila igano kwa kuwatowela nhonya kulawa kilanga na kuwapa mbena kwa mhela wake, nakawapa chilyo cha kuhega na kumemeza usangalalo kuli nhumbula za hemwe.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Hanga nawalonga ago geng'ha, nayali ngondo kuwalemeza wala wanhu kulavya nhambiko.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Aho ndo nawoya Wayahudi wamwe walawile Antiokiya na Ikonio, nawalongasa na wala wanhu na kilumba nawo, nawamtowa na maganga Paoli na kumbulunha mbaka hanze ha muji nawejesa kota nakabagama. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ila walanguswa lowekungajize na kumzunguluta, nakenuka na kuhiluka kuli muji. Mitondo, heye hamwe na Balinaba nawaluta Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli na Balinaba wanguhiluka kuli muji wa Antiokiya ako Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paoli na Balinaba lowadamle Mbuli Inojile ako Delibe na wanhu wenji kuwawinza, nawenula majendo kuluta Antiokiya kwa kukolela Lustila na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Nawawakangaza nhumbula walanguswa leka wawe nzinzili kuli makundo. Nawawalonjela, “Naitugana tweng'ha kukolela kuli magazo menji leka twinjile kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Nawawahagula wasekulu kuli chila chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kwa kwesela kulya na kulanda, nawawawika kwa Mkulu yawele nawali wangumkunda.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Hamba nawakola kuli isi ya Pisidiya, nawafika Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Lowadamle ulonzi wa Nguluwi ako Peliga, nawaluta Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kulawa Ataliya nawenula majendo kwa meli nawahiluka Antiokiya kuwele aho mwaluko nawali watogoligwe kwa chiwalo cha Isungu lya Nguluwi kwa mijito jiwele lelo nawajeneza.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Lowafichile Antiokiya nawadita nhing'hano na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu cha honhu hala, nawawalonjela kuwala mbuli zeng'ha Nguluwi zoyaziditile hamwe na hewo na ndaze vyoyawachumulile wanhu wa isi zinji lwizi leka wenjile kuli makundo. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Nawekala hamwe na wala walanguswa kwa mhela winji.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Nhing'hano ako Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wanhu wanji nawafika Antiokiya kulawa Yudeya, nawaluka kuwalangusa wala wanhu wa hala wolonga, “Wone hamwinjile ikumbi kota chihendo choyalanguse Musa, hamloholigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Mbuli ayi nayambuza kitwanza ng'hatu, hamba Paoli na Balinaba hamwe na wanhu wanji wa chila chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu hala Antiokiya nawahaguligwa leka walute Yelusalemu kulongasa mbuli ayi na watumigwa na wasekulu.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Lelo, chilundo cha wanhu walingukunda Kilistu nachiwalaga, nawo lowawele wokola Foinike na Samaliya nawawalonjela wanhu vila wanhu wa isi zinji vyowamgalamchile Nguluwi. Mbuli azo naziwasangalaza ng'hatu wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Lowafichile Yelusalemu nawabocheligwa na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na watumigwa na wasekulu, Aho ndo Paoli na Balinaba nawawalonjela kuwala geng'ha Nguluwi goyaditile hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ila wanhu wamwe wa chilundo cha Mafalisayo nawema na kulonga, “Naiwagana awo wanhu wa isi zinji wenjizwe ikumbi na kulanguswa kukunda malajizo ga Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Lelo watumigwa na wasekulu nawadita nhing'hano leka walongase goya kuwala mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Lowalongase lukami, Petili nakema na kulonga, “Wang'holozangu, mwanguvizela kota aho mwaluko Nguluwi nakanyhagula hali hemwe leka ndamle Mbuli Inojile kwa wanhu wa isi zinji leka wahuliche na kukunda. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Naye Nguluwi yalinguzizela nhumbula za wanhu, nakatawiza kota nakawakunda kwa kuwapa Muhe Yelile kota vyoyatupele hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nguluwi halajile uganililo woneche hali hetwe na hewo, ila nakeliza nhumbula za hewo kwa makundo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Lekachoni mwangumjeza Nguluwi kwa kuwadwika awo walanguswa mhomholo iwele hetwe na wasekulu wa hetwe natulemwela kuipika? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ileche kuwa ahyo, ila twangukunda kota twanguloholigwa kwa isungu lya Mkulu Yesu kota hewo vyowaloholigwe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele naweting'hana aho nawenyamalila, nawawahulichiza Paoli na Balinaba vyowawele wolonga kuwala ulajilo na vinduzanduza viwele Nguluwi nakavidita kwa kukolela moko gawo kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Lowasindile kulonga, Yakubu nakalonga, “Wang'holozangu mhulichize! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni nakatulonjela vila Nguluwi vyoyawahagule wanhu wa isi zinji kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heye. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mbuli ayi naiwhana ng'hatu na ulonzi wa waloli, kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘Lozimala mbuli azi ndohiluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuyimiza ng'handa ya Daudi igwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">ndogagongomanya kahi mahame gake na kuzenga kahi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Ahyo wanhu wasigale weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wawele nandiwachema wawe wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">wompala Mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ahyo ndo vyoyalingulonga Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">yaditile mbuli ayi chizeleche kulawila katali.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakubu nakalutilila kulonga, “Ahyo, kwamula kwa heni ndo aku, tuleche kuwagaza wanhu wa isi zinji wawele wangumgalamchila Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ila tuwahilichile baluwa kuwalonjela kota waleche kulya vilyo vikokomoche viwele navitambichilwa jimalukolo ja milungu na waleche ung'hondwa na waleche kulya igongolo liwele halidumuligwe singo na waleche kunwa danda. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwa vila kwa Mhela winji ulonzi wa Musa wangudamligwa kuli chila muji na kusomigwa kuli masunagogi geng'ha kuli chila Zuwa lya Kwesela.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa kwa chilundo cha walingumkunda Kilistu wa wanhu wa isi zinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Watumigwa na wasekulu hamwe na chilundo cha wanhu chilingumkunda Kilistu, nawawahagula wanhu hali hewo na kuwalajiza Antiokiya. Lelo nawawahagula Sila na Yuda yalinguchemigwa Balisaba, wanhu awa nawali vilongozi hali hewo leka walutase na Paoli na Balinaba. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Nawawapa baluwa yandichigwe hino, “Hetwe watumigwa na wasekulu na wang'holozenu, twanguwalamsa hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji muwele ako Antiokiya na Siliya na Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Natuhulika kota hana wanhu wamwe nawoya kwa hemwe kulawa kwa hetwe, nawawatunya kwa ulonzi wa hewo na kuwadita muwe na lunhwinhwi mnhumbula. Ila nawadita ahyo ne kukundizwa na munhu yoneche hali hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ahyo natwamula hamwe kuwahagula wanhu wamwe na kuwalajiza kwa hemwe, wochilongoza na wala wotuwaganile wawele ndo Balinaba na Paoli, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />wala wawele nawauwika ukomu wa hewo mmoko kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ahyo twanguwalajiza Yudasi na Sila, wano wowalonjela mbuli zotwandiche. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kwa vila nainoga kwa Muhe Yelile na hetwe tuleche kuwadwika mhomolo yoneche ng'hulu, ila mbuli azi ziwele zanguganigwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mleche kulya chilyo chitambichilwe jimalukolo na mleche kunwa danda na mleche kulya miwunde ja igongolo lyohalidumuligwe singo na miwiche kutali na ung'hondwa. Wone miwiche kutali na mbuli azi, mowa mditile goya. Malumbo!”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Lowawalajile, awo wasenga nawaluta Antiokiya kuwele nawachema nhing'hano ya chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, nawawapa ayo baluwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Lowasomile ayo baluwa, ulonzi wandichigwe amo nauwakangaza nhumbula, nawasangalala ng'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudasi na Sila hewo nawali waloli, nawalonga ulonzi winji wa kuwakangaza nhumbula na kuwadita wawe nzinzili kuli makundo wala wanhu wawele nawakunda. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Lowekale ako Antiokiya kwa mhela winji, wanhu wa Antiokiya nawawalaga na kuwagana walute kwa kikala goya, hamba nawahiluka kwa wala wawele nawawalajiza. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ila Sila nakalutilila kikala ako.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paoli na Balinaba nawasigala Antiokiya kwa mhela winji kuno wowalangusa na kudamla ulonzi wa Mkulu hamwe na wanhu wanji wenji.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli na Balinaba wangibagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mhela umwenga hamba, Paoli nakamlonjela Balinaba, “Tuhiluche kuli miji jeng'ha kuwele natudamla usenga wa Mkulu kwa wanhu, leka tone kota wangulutilila ndaze.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balinaba nakagana wamhole Yohani yalinguchemigwa Malichi. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ila Paoli haganile wamhole Malichi, kwa vila aho mwaluko nakawaleka kula Pamfiliya, nahaganile kulutilila kukola mijito na hewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Lelo, nakwali na kitwanza ng'hatu hali Paoli na Balinaba kuwala mbuli ayi, ahyo nawebagula. Balinaba nakamhola Malichi, nawakwina meli kuluta Kupilo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ila Paoli nakamhagula Sila na kuka hala du lowalandilwe kunoga kulawa kwa Mkulu na wanhu wa honhu hala. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Paoli na Sila nawakolela Siliya na Kilikiya, wowakangaza nhumbula vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoteyi kangilongoza hamwe na Paoli na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paoli nakafika Delibe na Lustila, kuwele nakekala mlanguswa yumwe yalinguchemigwa Timoteyi. Mamo wa Timoteyi naye nayali mlanguswa yawele Myahudi, ila mhaza wa heye nayali Mgilichi. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoteyi nayali na lutogo lukulu hali wala wanhu wa Lustila na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paoli nakagana Timoteyi yelongoze kuli majendo ga heye, ahyo nakamwinjiza ikumbi. Nakadita ahyo kwa vila Wayahudi weng'ha wawelengikala honhu aho nawavizela kota mhaza wa Timoteyi nayali Mgilichi. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Lowawele wokola kuli jila miji nawawalonjela wanhu malajizo galajizwe na watumigwa na wasekulu kula Yelusalemu, nawawalonjela wagawinze. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ahyo, vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu navyali nzinzili kuli makundo na wanhu wawele na makundo nawonjezeka chila zuwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uloli wa Paoli kula Makedonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paoli na wayage nawakola honhu ha Filugiya na Galatiya, kwa vila Muhe Yelile hawakundize kudamla awo usenga kuli mkowa wa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Lowafichile kuli mbaka wa Musia, nawajeza kwinjila kuli mkowa wa Bituniya, ila Muhe wa Yesu hawakundize. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Lelo, nawakolela Musia, nawaluta mbaka Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mhela wa nechilo, Paoli nakona ulotezi uwele nakamona munhu wa Makedoniya yemile yomlanda, “Uloche, uye Makedoniya ututanze!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paoli loyonile ulotezi awo, natiwika goya kuluta Makedoniya, kuno tuwele tukundile kota Nguluwi nayali nakatuchema kudamla Mbuli Inojile ako.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludia kanguloholigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kulawa Tiloa, natuka kwa meli mbaka Samotilake na mitondo natufika Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kulawa ako natwinula majendo mbaka Filipi, muji ukulu wa wilaya ya Makedoniya, kahi ndo uwele wangulongozwa na Waloma. Natikala ako kwa mazuwa mado. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Zuwa lya Kwesela natuluta hanze ha muji, natuluta hafungo ha lwanda kuwele natijesa kota ndo honhu ha kulandila. Natikalisa, natudawala na wadala wawele nawekungajiza honhu aho. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Yumwe wa wala wadala wawele nawali wotuhulichiza nayali yochemigwa Ludia, nayali yalinguguza nguwo za kitani za lanji ya zambalau, mwenyeng'haye wa Tuatila, nayali yomdumba Nguluwi. Mkulu nakagubula nhumbula ya heye mbaka nakaubochela wula ulonzi uwele Paoli nayali yolonga. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Lowabatizigwe, mdala ayo hamwe na wanhu wa ng'handa ya heye nakatulalika kaye kwa heye yolonga, “Ndikomya, wone namona kota heni nandimkunda Mkulu, ndanguwalanda muye mikale kaye kwa heni.” Nakatudedeza tulute.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli na Sila wangibatigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Zuwa limwe lotuwele tuluta kuli honhu ha kulandila, natiting'hana na mhinza yawele na chijeni cha kulagula. Mhinza ayo nayali nakawadita wakulu wa heye wawe na sendi nyinji kwa kukola mijito ajo ja kulagula. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ayo mhinza nayali yomuwinza Paoli na hetwe kuno yotowa iyowe na kulonga, “Wanhu awa ndo vitumagwa wa Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya Ng'hatu. Wanguwawikulila nzila ya kuloholigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nakalutilila kudita ahyo kwa mazuwa menji mbaka zuwa limwe Paoli nakazudila, nakamgalamchila na kuchilonjela acho chijeni, “Ndangukulonjela kwa itagwa lya Yesu Kilistu, ulawe kwa munhu ayu!” Baho du, acho chijeni nachimlawa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Lelo, wakulu wa yula mhinza lowawene kota hawoweza kupata sendi kahi kulawa kwa yula mhinza yawele nawali ngitumbila, nawawebata Paoli na Sila, nawawabulunha mbaka kwa vilongozi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Nawawalonjeleza kwa watagusa wolonga, “Wanhu awa ndo Wayahudi na wangigala ivuche kuli muji wa hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wangulangusa vihendo viwele hetwe wanhu wa Loma hambe tuganigwe kuvikunda ne kuviwinza.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Chilundo cha wanhu nachilumba kuwatowa na wala watagusa nawalonga kota wawavule nguwo na wawazape ng'hobwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Lowatowigwe lukami nawawichigwa mchinweng'ho na mwamizi wa chinweng'ho nakalonjelwa kota yawamile ng'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kwa malajizo ago, ayo mwamizi nakawawika kuli chihengo cha kugati ng'hatu mwa chinweng'ho na kugawoha magulu ga hewo kwa minyololo.<figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16:24">Wanhu weli wawohigwe ngwamo</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Loifichile nechilo ng'hatu, Paoli na Sila nawali womlanda Nguluwi na kwimba nzimbo za kumtogola Nguluwi kuno wanji wawele mchinweng'ho wohulichiza. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Baho du nalilawila limachinyhina likulu liwele nalitigasa msisi wa chinweng'ho. Baho du lwizi jeng'ha najichumuka na minyololo jiwele nawawawoha najichumuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mwamizi wa chinhweng'ho loyalilimche na kona lwizi ja chinweng'ho ja mwazi, nakejesa kota weng'ha wawele nawahindilwa mchinweng'ho nawabilima, ahyo nakasomola ipanga lyake, nakagana kikopola. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ila Paoli nakamchema kwa lizi likulu, “Uleche kikopola, hetwe tweng'ha twa hano.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yula mwamizi nakalajiza vyenje vigaligwe, nakenjila mgati mwa chila chihengo cha chinweng'ho, nakafugama kuno yokakama hali Paoli na Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Hamba nakawegala kunze, nakawauza, “Wakulu, ndite choni leka mhate kuloholigwa?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Nawamwidichila, “Umkunde mkulu Yesu nagwe koloholigwa hamwe na wanhu wa ng'handa ya hegwe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Lelo, nawadamla ulonzi wa Mkulu kwa heye hamwe na wanhu wa ng'handa ya heye. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mhela wuwula yula mwamizi nakawahola na kuhovuga vilonda vya hewo, hamba heye na wanhu wa ng'handa heye nawabatizigwa ne kukawila. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Hamba nakawahola Paoli na Sila mbaka kaye kwa heye, nakawapa chilyo. Heye hamwe na wanhu wa ng'handa ya heye nawadita mvina kwa vila nawali womkunda Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Lokubwemwenzuche, watagusa nawawalajiza vilongozi kwa wakulu wa chinweng'ho wolonga, “Muwadoholele wala wanhu, muwaleche walute.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Yula mwamizi wa chinweng'ho nakamlonjela Paoli, “Watagusa nawalajiza kota ndiwachumulile. Lelo mlawe na mlute kwa kikala goya.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ila Paoli nakamlonjela, “Nawatutowa hali wanhu ne kutulonjeleza na kutulonjela twidichile, hamba nawatuwika mchinweng'ho hanga hetwe twa wanhu wa Loma. Lelo, wangugana kutulavya kwa uviso! Wanguganigwa woye watuchumulile wawo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Awo vilongozi nawawalonjela watagusa kuwala mbuli ayo, lowahuliche kota Paoli na Sila nawali wanhu wa Loma nawadumba. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ahyo, nawaluta kuwadedeza, nawawalavya mchinweng'ho na nawawalanda walawe kuli muji wula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paoli na Sila nawalawa kuli chinweng'ho, nawaluta haluga ha Ludia. Ako naweting'hana na chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, nawawakangaza nhumbula hamba nawoka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Ivuche ako Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Nawenula majendo kwa kukolela Amfipoli na Apoloniya mbaka nawafika Tesalonike kuwele nakwali na sunagogi lya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paoli nakenjila kuli sunagogi kota vyoyazowele, nakalongasa nawo kwa mhela wa mazuwa gadatu ga kwesela kwa Maandiko Matakatifu. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Nakawalonjela na kuwalajila kota naiganigwa Kilistu kugazigwa na kuzilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame. Nakawalonjela, “Yesu yawele heni ndangumdamla kwa hemwe ndo Kilistu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wamwe wa Wayahudi nawakunda, nawelumba na Paoli na Sila, kahi Wagilichi wenji walingumdumba Nguluwi hamwe na wadala wenji wang'hangala nawelumba nawo.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ila Wayahudi wawele hawakundile nawali na fihi, nawawakungajiza wanhu wehile kulawa kuli honhu ha kuguzila vinhu kwa kikundiza kuwapa chinhu, nawadita nhing'hano na kwaluchiza ivuche kuli muji weng'ha. Nawaluta kuli ng'handa ya Yasoni kuno wochijesa kota wowafika Paoli na Sila leka wawegale hali wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ila hawawafichile, ahyo nawawabulunha Yasoni na wamwe wa wanhu wanji walingumkunda Kilistu mbaka kwa vilongozi wa Muji, nawatowa iyowe wolonga, “Wanhu awa ndo waigalamle isi na sambi wa kuli muji awu. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni nakawawika hakaye hake. Awa weng'ha wangulibelenhuka ilajizo lya Kaizali, wangulonga, ‘Hana mndewa yunji yalinguchemigwa Yesu.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kwa ulonzi awo nawawadita vilongozi wa muji na chilundo cha wanhu wawe na lunhwinhwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Nawawadita Yasoni na wayage walavye sendi kwa chiwalo cha kulechelwa, hamba wawalechela walute.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli na Sila ako Belea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Nechilo yiyila wala wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu nawawahilika Paoli na Sila mbaka Belea. Lowafichile ako nawaluta kuli sunagogi lya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wanhu wa ako nawali walinguhulichiza ng'hatu kusinda wanhu wa Tesalonike. Nawasangalala lowahuliche usenga woyawalonjele Paoli. Nawagalola goya Maandiko Matakatifu kuli chila zuwa, leka kuvizela kota gowahuliche ndo gakukomya. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wanhu wenji nawakunda wawele ndo wadala wang'hangala wa Chigilichi na walume wa chigilichi kahi.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ila Wayahudi wa Tesalonike lowahuliche kota Paoli kangudamla ulonzi wa Nguluwi ako Belea, nawaluta ako leka kuwadita wanhu wekungajize na kwaluchiza ivuche. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Wala wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu nawamhilika Paoli himahima mbaka mwhani, ila Sila na Timoteyi nawasigala Belea. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wala wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wawele nawamhilika Paoli nawaluta hamwe na heye mbaka Asene. Hamba nawahiluka wawele na malajizo kulawa kwa Paoli kota Sila na Timoteyi wamuwinze himahima.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulongasa na wanhu wa Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paoli loyawele yowabeteza Sila na Timoteyi ako Asene, nhumbula ya heye naizudila ng'hatu loyauwene muji awo vyoumemile jimalukolo ja milungu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nakalongasa na Wayahudi na wanhu wanji wawele ngumdumba Nguluwi kuli sunagogi na chila zuwa nayali yolongasa na weng'ha wawele nawoya kuli honhu ha mwazi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wamwe wa walangusa wa vilundo vya Epikulo na Stoiki nawaluka kitwanza na Paoli. Wamwe nawalonga, “Munhu ayu kangugana kulonga choni?” Wanji nawalonga, “Kangoneka kota kangudamla kuwala milungu ja chijenzi.” Nawalonga ahi kwa vila Paoli nayali yodamla kuwala Yesu na vila vyoyazilipuche. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ahyo nawamhola Paoli, nawamigala Aleopago, nawamlonjela, “Twangugana kuvizela ayi mbuli inyale youwele ngulonga. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Vinhu vinji vyotuvihuliche kuli makutu ga hetwe vyangububuwaza. Twangugana kuvizela mbuli azi zina mana yachi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Wanhu wa Asene na wajenzi weng'ha wa ako nawali wotumiya mhela wa hewo weng'ha kisimila na kuhulichiza mbuli zinyale.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Lelo, Paoli nakema hali chitala cha Aleopago, nakalonga, “Hemwe wanhu wa Asene! Ndangona kota kuli chila mbuli hemwe mwangoneka ndo wanhu mlinguwinza nzila ya kumfugamila Nguluwi ng'hatu, <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />kwa vila londiwele ndikola aku na ako kuno ndilola jimalukolo ja hemwe ja kufugamila, nambona honhu hamwe ha kulavila nhambiko hawele nahandichigwa, ‘KWA NGULUWI YOHAMBE YAZELECHE.’ Lelo, ayo yomuwele ngumfugamila ne kumzela ndo yondilingumdamla kwa hemwe.” <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Nguluwi yalumbile isi yeng'ha na vyeng'ha viwele amo, ndo Mkulu wa kilanga na isi, heye hambe yekale kuli ng'handa za Nguluwi zizenjigwe na wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Hambe yakolelwe mijito kwa moko ga wanhu kota kangugana chinhu choneche, kwa vila heye ndo yalinguwapa wanhu ukomu na lweselo na chila chinhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kwa kukolela munhu yumwe nakawalumba wanhu weng'ha wa isi na kuwadita wekale kuli isi yeng'ha. Nakawika mhela wa kikala. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nguluwi nakadita ahyo leka wanhu awo wampale hanji womfika hanga kwa kupabasapabasa waweze kumona hanga halingikala kutali na chila yumwe wa hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kota vyoyalonjile munhu yumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">“ ‘Mgati mwa heye twangikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Twangujenda na kuwa na ukomu.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Kota wamwe wa walingwandika nzimbo wa hemwe vyowalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">“ ‘Hetwe twa wana wa heye.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Wone hetwe twa wana wa Nguluwi, hatulinguganigwa kumjesa Nguluwi ka kota zahabu ama sendi ama iganga lihongoligwe na kunoligwa na wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Katali Nguluwi nakedita kota halingona, ila sambi kanguwagana wanhu weng'ha chila honhu wamgalamchile. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwa vila nakaliwika zuwa liwele koitagusa isi yeng'ha kwa hachi kwa nzila ya munhu yumwe yamhagule. Nguluwi nakatawiza kwa weng'ha mbuli ayi kwa kumzilipula munhu ayo kulawa kwa wabagame!”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Lowamhuliche Paoli yolonga kuwala mbuli ya kuzilipuka kwa wabagame, wamwe wa hewo nawaseka, ila wanji nawalonga, “Twangugana kukuhulika kahi kuwala mbuli ayi!” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ahyo, Paoli nakalawa, nakawaleka kuli chitala. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ila wamwe wa hewo nawelumba na heye, nawakunda. Hali hewo nayali Dionisio wa Aleopago na mdala yumwe yalinguchemigwa Damali na wanhu wanji.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kula Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Logapulute ago, Paoli nakoka Asene, nakuluta Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ako Kolinto, nakamfika Myahudi yalinguchemigwa Akula, mlelwa wa Ponto. Akula hamwe na mche wa heye yalinguchemigwa Pilisikila, nawali wahiluche kulawa Italiya kuli mazuwa gagala kwa vila Kaizali Klaudiyo nayali yawalonjele Wayahudi weng'ha woche Loma. Paoli nakaluta kuwalola, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />kwa vila nawali wawanzi wa kuhona mahema kota heye, Paoli nakekala na kukola mijito hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Chila Zuwa lya Kwesela nayali yolongasa kuli sunagogi yojeza kuwadita Wayahudi na Wagilichi welumbe na heye.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoteyi lowafichile kulawa Makedoniya, nawamfika Paoli yotumiya mhela wa heye weng'ha kudamla na kuwalonjela Wayahudi kota Yesu ndo Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Lowamtowile na kwaluka kumliga, nakakung'huna mivalo ja heye hali hewo yolonga, “Wone mwokwajilila mane mwemwe, heni ndahela nongwa yoneche kuwala mbuli ayo. Kulawila sambi ndanguluta kwa wanhu wa isi zinji.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Hamba nakoka aho nakaluta kikala kuli ng'handa ya munhu yumwe yalingumdumba Nguluwi yalinguchemigwa Tito Yusto, yawele ng'handa ya heye nayali habehi na lila sunagogi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Chilongozi wa lila sunagogi yalinguchemigwa Kilisipo, nakamkunda Mkulu, heye hamwe na wanhu weng'ha wa ng'handa ya heye. Wakolinto wenji nawauhulichiza usenga awo, nawakunda na kubatizigwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Zuwa limwe nechilo, Mkulu nakamlonjela Paoli kuli ulotezi, “Uleche kudumba, ulutilile kudamla ne kutweguka nhumbula, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwa vila nda hamwe na hegwe. Haduhu munhu yawele yojeza kukulumiza kwa vila kuli muji awu hana wanhu wenji wawele ndo wanhu wa heni.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Lelo, Paoli nekekala ako kwa mhela wa mwaka umwe ana nusu, yolangusa ulonzi wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mhela Galio loyawele chilongozi wa mkowa wa Akaya, Wayahudi nawamvaba Paoli na kumigala kuli chitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Nawalonga, “Twangumlonjeleza munhu ayu kwa chiwalo cha kuwadita wanhu wamdumbe Nguluwi vila vyohaiganigwe na malajizo ga Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Kung'hali Paoli hanakwaluka kulonga, Galio nakawalonjela Wayahudi, “Mhulichize hemwe Wayahudi! Wone mkomya mbuli ayi yahawele kuwala kuwifya ama wihe ndahawele goya kuwahulichiza. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ila kwa vila yanguwala ulonzi na matagwa na malajizo ga hemwe, mwamule mwemwe. Hambe ngane kuwa mtagusa wa mbuli azo!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Lelo, nakawawinga kuli chitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Aho ndo nawamibata Sostene yawele ndo chilongozi wa sunagogi, nawamtowa hali chitala. Ila Galio nahajesile mbuli ayo ne hado.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguhiluka kahi Antiokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paoli nakekala na awo wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Kolinto kwa Mazuwa menji. Hamba nakawalaga, nakakwina meli kuluta Siliya hamwe na Pilisikila na Akula. Lowafichile Kenikilea, nakabeya mnvili za heye za kumutwi kwa vila nayali yawichile chilaho. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Nawafika Efeso, Paoli nakawaleka Pilisikila na Akula, nakaluta kuli sunagogi, nakalongasa na Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Nawamlanda yekale na hewo kwa mhela wa mazuwa menji ila nakalema. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ila loyawele yokuka, nakalonga, “Ndohiluka wone Nguluwi yagane.” Hamba nakoka Efeso kwa meli.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Meli nayima Kaisaliya, naye Paoli nakaluta Yelusalemu kuchilamsa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, hamba nakaluta Antiokiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Loyekale ako kwa mhela uchefu, hamba nakalutilila na majendo kwa kukolela honhu ha Galatiya na Fulugiya kuno yowakangaza nhumbula walanguswa weng'ha.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo kangudamla Efeso na Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Myahudi yumwe yalinguchemigwa Apolo, mlelwa wa Alekizandilia, nakafika Efeso. Nayali munhu yalinguvizela kulonga goya na yalingugazela goya Maandiko Matakatifu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Nayali yalanguswe kuwala nzila ya Mkulu na nayali yolutilila kwa kugana, nakalangusa goya kuwala Yesu, hanga nakauzela ubatizo wa Yohani hela. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Pilisikila na Akula lowamhuliche vila vyolonga goya kuli sunagogi, nawamhola na kumlangusa goya nzila ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo loyaganile kuluta Akaya, wala wanhu wawele nawamkumkunda Kilistu nawamkangaza nhumbula kwa kwandika baluwa kwa walanguswa wa kula Akaya kota wambochele. Loyafichile ako nakawatanza ng'hatu wala wawele nawakunda kwa igano lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />kwa vila nakalutililila kuwasumya Wayahudi hazelu kuno yotawiza kwa Maandiko Matakatifu kota Yesu ndo Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kangudamla kula Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Mhela Apolo loyawele Kolinto, Paoli nakenula majendo kuluta Efeso kwa kukolela kuli isi ya vidunda. Ako nakawafika walanguswa wamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Nakawauza, “Ndaze, lomkundile namumbochela Muhe Yelile?” Nawamwidichila, “Hebu! Hatuhuliche kota hana Muhe Yelile.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Paoli nakawauza, “Nambatizigwa ndaze?” Nawamwidichila, “Kwa ubatizo wa Yohani.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paoli nakalonga, “Ubatizo wa Yohani nawali wa kulajila kota wanhu nawamgalamchila Nguluwi. Yohani nakawalonjela wanhu wamkunde yula yalinguya honhu ha heye, yawele ndo Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Lowahuliche ago, nawabatizigwa kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Lelo, Paoli kawawichila moko kuli vitwi vya hewo na Muhe Yelile nakawadulichila, nawaluka kulonga kwa ndonga za chijenzi na kulavya uloli. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Awo weng'ha nawali kota walume kumi na weli.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kwa mhela wa myezi jidatu, Paoli nayali yoluta kuli sunagogi ne kudumba, nayali yolongasa na wanhu na kujeza kuwadita wawe kuli ubanzi wa heye kuli mbuli za Undewa wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ila wamwe wa hewo nawali wajuvi, nawalema kukunda, nawaluka kulonga vibi kuwala ayo nzila ya Mkulu hali nhing'hano ya wanhu. Aho Paoli nakaleka kulongasa na hewo, nakawahola wala walanguswa wa heye, nayali yolongasa na hewo chila zuwa kuli ng'handa ya kulangusila ya Tulano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Nakalutilila kudita ahyo kwa mhela wa miyaka mili mbaka Wayahudi na Wagilichi wawele nawali wochikala ako Asiya nawahulika ulonzi wa Mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Sikewa wangujeza kuwinga vijeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nguluwi nakadita vinduzanduza vya kububuwaza kwa moko ga Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Wanhu nawali wohola vibende na mivalo jinji jiwele najidoliza lukuli lwa Paoli, nawajigala kwa watamwa, nawo nawoselwa matamwa ga hewo na wala wawele na vijeni, vijeni avyo naviwalawa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Lelo, wamwe wa Wayahudi nawali wojenda aku na ako wowinga vijeni kwa wanhu. Wayahudi awa nawajeza kutumiya itagwa lya Mkulu kuvilavya vijeni kwa wanhu. Weng'ha nawali wolonga, “Ndanguwalonjela muche kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Yesu yawele Paoli kangumdamla.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Wana saba wa Sikewa, mtambika mkulu wa Wayahudi, nawali hali awo wawele wodita ahyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ila chijeni nachiwedichilla, “Yesu ndangumzela kahi Paoli ndangumzela, ila hemwe mwa whaani?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Hamba yula munhu yawele na chijeni nakawanyozochela, nakawatowa ng'hatu, nakawasumya weng'ha. Nawalawa wobilima kulawa mgati mwa yila ng'handa kuno wawele mwanzi na walumile. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Mbuli ayi naizeleka kwa Wayahudi na Wagilichi weng'ha walingikala Efeso. Weng'ha nawali na lunhwinhwi, nawalitogola itagwa lya Mkulu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wenji wa wala wawele nawali nawakunda kuli mhela awu nawoya na kulonga gehile ga hewo hazelu kuwala madito ga hewo gehile. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wanji wawele nawadita mbuli za uhawi aho mwaluko nawakungajiza vitabu vya hewo, nawavilakaza hazelu. Lowawazile hisabu ya sendi ziwele nazitumika kugula vitabu avyo viwele navilakazwa nayali vihande elufu makumi gahano ga sendi (50,000). <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ahyo ulonzi wa Mkulu nawenela ng'hatu na kuwa na mong'ho.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivuche ako Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Lozilawile mbuli azo, Paoli nakamula kuluta Yelusalemu kwa kukolela Makedoniya na Akaya. Nakalonga, “Londifika ako, ndanguganigwa kuluta Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ahyo nakawalajiza vitumagwa wa heye weli, wawele ndo Timoteyi na Elasito, walongole kuluta Makedoniya, naye nakasigala Asiya kwa mazuwa mado.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mhela awo nakulawila ivuche likulu ako Efeso kwa chiwalo cha nzila ya Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Nakwali na munhu yumwe yalingugongomanya sendi yalinguchemigwa Demetiliyo, yawele na mijito ya kugongomanya jimalukolo ja sendi ja ng'handa ya mlungu wa chidala yalinguchemigwa Alitemi. Mijito ajo najiwadita walingugongomanya wa heye wapate chinhu cha mzidi chikulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetiliyo nakawakungajiza wakola mijito awo hamwe na wanji wawele na mijito kota ajo, nakawalonjela, “Hemwe wanhu, mwanguvizela kota lufufu lwetu lwangulawa kuli mijito aji. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Lelo namuhulika na kona mwemwe mbuli ziwele Paoli kanguzidita, haiwele hano Efeso hela, ila kuli Asiya yeng'ha. Heye kanguwagalamula wanhu wenji na kuwadita waleche kukunda kota milungu jiwele najigongomanywa na wanhu hajiwele milungu ne hado. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ahyo haiwele kota mijito ja hetwe jobezigwa hela ila mbaka ng'handa ya mlungu wa Alitemi, yawele mkulu, yalingufugamilwa kuli Asiya yeng'ha yowahela lutogo lwa mlungu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Lowahuliche ulonzi awo, nawazudila, nawaluka kutowa iyowe, “Mkulu ndo Alitemi wa Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Muji weng'ha naumema ivuche. Nawamibata Gayo na Alisitako, wenyeng'haye wa Makedoniya wawele nawali wojenda hamwe na Paoli, lowewabatile nawabilima mbaka kuli lugagala lwa kuvinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paoli nakagana kwinjila hagati ha lula lung'hongola, ila walanguswa nawamlemeza. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Vilongozi wanji wa mkowa awo wa Asiya, wawele ndo goloko wa heye, nawalajiza usenga kwa Paoli kumdedeza yaleche kwinjila kuli lugagala alo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mhela awo chila munhu nayali yolonga chila yachizelele, wamwe nawalonga ali na wanji nawalonga lila, mbaka yila nhing'hano naitizika. Wenji nahawavizelele choni chiwele nachambuza kuting'hana kwa hewo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wayahudi nawamkundujiza Alekizanda kumwando, wanhu wamwe kuli yila nhing'hano nawejesa kota ndo heye. Alekizanda nakawagololela moko wala wanhu yowagana wasindamale leka yelewele hali lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ila lowavizele kota nayali Myahudi, weng'ha nawatowa iyowe kwa lizi limwe kwa mhela wa masaa meli wolonga, “Mkulu ndo Alitemi wa Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Hamba yalingwandika wa muji nakawadita wanyamalile, nakawalonjela, “Hemwe wanhu wa Efeso, ndaze, isi yeng'ha haivizelele kota muji wa Efeso ndo ulinguilolela ng'handa ya mlungu Alitemi yawele ndo mkulu na kulilolela lila limalukolo liwele naligwa kulawa kilanga? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Haduhu yalinguweza kulema mbuli azo. Ahyo, msindamale, mleche kudita chinhu choneche himahima. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Namuwegala wanhu awa aha hanga hawahizile kuli ng'handa ya mlungu ne kumliga mlungu wa hetwe wa chidala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Lelo, wone Demetiliyo na wakola mijito wa heye wana ulonjelezi kuwala wanhu awa, hana vitala vya wakulu wa mikowa, wanguweza kuwalonjeleza ako. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ila wone hana mbuli yinji muigale kuli nhing'hano ilinguzeleka iwele naitanganika. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kota vyotuwele sambi twa habehi kulonjelezwa kwa kudita ivuche kwa chiwalo cha mbuli iwele naikoleka lehano. Kwa vila twahela chiwalo cha kulonga ne kulajila kota ndo mwaluko wa ivuche ali.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, nakabena nhing'hano.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguluta kahi Makedoniya na Ugilichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Lolimalile lila ivuche, Paoli nakawachema hamwe wala walanguswa, nakawakangaza nhumbula. Hamba nakawalaga, nakenula majendo kuluta Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kuli majendo ga heye ga kuluta Makedoniya nakakola chila honhu yowakangaza nhumbula walanguswa kwa ulonzi winji. Hamba nakaluta Ugilichi <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />kuwele nakekala kwa myezi jidatu. Loyawele yochiwika goya kuluta Siliya, nakavizela kota Wayahudi nawali wochiwika goya kumditila vibi, ahyo nakamula kuhiluka kwa kukolela Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Paoli nayali yelongoze na Sopatilo mwana wa Pilo, kulawa Beleya, kahi nakelongoza na Alisitaliko na Sekundo kulawa Tesalonike na Gayo kulawa Delibe, kahi Timoteo na Tukiko na Tilofimo kulawa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Wanhu awo nawalongola kuka, nawambeteza Paoli ako Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ila hetwe natwinula majendo kwa meli kwa mhela wa mazuwa gahano kulawa Filipi kulawila hala loimalile mnvina ya mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso, natwe natilumba na wanji ako Tiloa, kuwele natikala kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiting'hana na wanhu wa Tiloa lwa kuduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Zuwa lya Kwesela natiting'hana kwa chiwalo cha kumogola ibumunda. Paoli nakalongasa na wanhu mbaka nechilo ng'hatu kwa vila nayali yewichile goya kuka mitondo yake. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kuli chihengo cha kuchanya, muwele naweting'hana namwali na vyenje vinji vilingulavya lumuli. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Msongolo yumwe yalinguchemigwa Eutuko nayali yekalise hali itubuli mhela Paoli loyawele yolutilila kudamla. Eutuko nakaluka kusinzila hamba nakabatigwa ng'hatu na usinjizi, nakagwa mbaka hasi kulawa kuchanya kuli chihengo chiwele kuli golofa ya kadatu. Nawamlokota yawele yabagame. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ila Paoli nakedulika hasi, nakawasa mchanya mwake na kumkumbatila, nakalonga, “Mleche kudumba kwa vila ukomu ung'hali mgati mwa heye.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Hamba Paoli nakakwina kuli golofa, nakamogola ibumunda, nakalya. Nakalutilila kudamla kwa mhela winji mbaka hamitondo, hamba nakoka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Wala wanhu nawamhilusa yula msongolo mbaka haluga hake kuno yawele mkomu nawo nawawa na uhembulizo ukulu.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majendo kulawa Tiloa kuluta Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Hetwe natukwina meli natulongola kuluta Aso kuwele twahamholile Paoli. Ahyo ndo vyoyaganile, kwa vila nakagana kufika ako kwa kukolela kuli isi ng'havu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Lelo, nakatufika kula Aso, nakakwina kuli meli, natuluta mbaka Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kulawa ako mitondo yake natufika Kio. Zuwa lya keli natufika Samo na mitondo yake tufika Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paoli nayali yogana kulutilila na majendo kwa meli ne kukolela Efeso leka yaleche kukawila ng'hatu ako Asiya. Nayali yogana yafiche Yelusalemu himahima kung'hali zuwa lya mnvina ya Pentekoste.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguwalaga wasekulu wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Paoli loyawele Mileto nakalajiza usenga kwa wasekulu wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wa ako Efeso leka weting'hane na heye. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Lowafichile nakawalonjela, “Mwanguvizela londikale na hemwe kulawila zuwa lya mwaluko lofichile hano Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Nandimkolela mijito Mkulu kwa kunyenyetela kweng'ha na mahozi kuno ndikwimilila magazo na kulemigwa kuwele nakufika heni kwa kiwhana na wihe wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mwanguvizela kota sidumbile kuwadamlila hazelu na kuli ng'handa za hemwe na kuwalangusa choneche chila chiwele chahawatanze hemwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nandiwakanya Wayahudi na Wagilichi kota yanguwagana wamgalamchile Nguluwi kwa kulonga gehile ga hewo na kumkunda Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Lelo, muhulichize! Ndangumhulichiza Muhe, ndanguluta Yelusalemu ne kuvizela kota chondawila choni ako. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ndanguvizela kota Muhe Yelile nakandonjela kuli chila honhu kota chinweng'ho na magazo ndo vilingubeteza. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ila hambe ndiwone ukomu wa heni kota ndo chinhu ng'hatu, ila sinde wula utumagwa wa heni na jila mijito joyamhele Mkulu Yesu ndijikole, jiwele ndo kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya isungu lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nang'hola hali hemwe weng'ha kuno ndidamla mbuli ya Undewa wa Nguluwi. Lelo ndanguvizela kota haduhu ne yumwe wa hemwe yawele kombona kahi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ndikomya, lelo ndanguwalonjela, wone yajilile munhu hali hemwe, ndahela nongwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwa vila silechile kuwadamlila igano lyeng'ha lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Milolele mwemwe na mchilolele chila chilundo cha wanhu chiwele Muhe Yelile nakawawika hemwe muwe walolezi wake. Mchidime chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu chiwele Nguluwi nakachigula kwa danda ya mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndanguvizela kota hala londikuka, mibwa ja kisolo jing'hang'hale jokuya hali hemwe, hajiwa na isungu kwa chilundo acho. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Mbaka hali hemwe kowa na wanhu wawele wolonga mbuli za udesi leka kuwajiliza wanhu na kuwadita wawawinze hewo hela. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ahyo, milolele kuno mkumbuchila kota kwa mhela wa miyaka jidatu, nechilo na nemisi, silechile kumkanya chila yumwe wa hemwe kwa mahozi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Lelo ndanguwawika hemwe hali wamizi wa Nguluwi na usenga wa isungu lya heye. Heye kana ludali lwa kuwawika goya na kuwadita mpate wula utambichizo uwele nakawawichila wanhu wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Siganile sendi ne zahabu ne mivalo ja munhu yoneche. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mwanguvizela kota nang'hola mijito kwa moko gangu leka mhate vinhu vyondilinguganigwa kupegwa na vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupegwa wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Kuli chila mbuli nandiwakanya kota kwa nzila ayi ya kukola mijito ng'hatu yangutugana kuwatanza ng'hochele kuno mkumbuchila ulonzi wa Mkulu Yesu woyatulonjele, ‘Fola kulavya kusinda kubochela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Loyalonjile ago, Paoli nakafugama hamwe na hewo weng'ha, nakamlanda Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Weng'ha nawalila, nawamlaga kwa kumkumbatila na kumnonela. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Mbuli iwele naiwadita wesinze ng'hatu nayali ndo ulonzi woyalonjile kota hawomona kahi. Lelo nawamhilika mbaka kuli meli.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguluta Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Lotilajile na hewo, natukwina meli na kuluta mbaka Kosi. Mitondo yake natufika Lode na kulawa ako natuluta Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ako, natuifika meli ilinguluta Foinike, natukwina. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Lotuchiwene chihilwa cha Kupulo, natukola ubanzi wa kusini natuluta mbaka Siliya. Meli nayima kuli muji wa Tilo, aho meli nayali inenula mhomolo yoipichile. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ako natuwafika wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, natikala na hewo kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba. Walanguswa awo nawalongozwa na Muhe Yelile, nawamlonjela Paoli yaleche kuluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ila mhela wa hetwe loumalile natuka. Wala walanguswa hamwe na wache wa hewo na wana wa hewo nawatuhilika mbaka hanze ha muji. Lotufichile mwhani, tweng'ha natufugama, natumlanda Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Hamba natilaga, hetwe natukwina meli, nawo nawahiluka haluga ha hewo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Natulutilila na majendo kulawa Tilo natufika Tolemaisi, hala natuwalamsa wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, natikala nawo kwa zuwa limwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Mitondo yake natuka natuluta Kaisaliya. Ako natuluta kaye kwa munhu yumwe yalingudamla Mbuli Inojile yalinguchemigwa Filipo. Heye nayali yumwe wa wala saba wawele nawahaguligwa, natikala kwa heye. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Filipo nayali na wahinza wane wohawanating'hana na walume, nawali wolavya uloli. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Lotikale ako mazuwa mado, nakoya mloli yumwe yalinguchemigwa Agabo kulawa Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Loyafichile kwa hetwe nakahola msipi wa Paoli, nakewoha kuli moko na magulu, nakalonga, “Muhe Yelile kangulonga hino, ‘Wayahudi wa kula Yelusalemu womuwoha hino munhu yawele na msipi awu na kumuwika kuli moko ga wanhu wa isi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Lotuhuliche ulonzi awo, hetwe na wala wanhu wanji wawele aho natumdedeza Paoli yaleche kuluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ila Paoli nakedichila, “Lekachoni mwangulila na kudita nhumbula ya heni itweguche? Ndagoya haiwele kuwichigwa mchinweng'ho hela mbaka kukopoligwa ako Yelusalemu kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya Mkulu Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Lotulemwele kumdedeza natuleka kumdedeza, natulonga, “Lyoyalingugana Mkulu likoleche!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Lotikale hala kwa mhela udo, natuhola vinhu vya hetwe na kuluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Walanguswa wamwe kulawa Kaisaliya nawaluta hamwe na hetwe na kutuhilika kaye kwa Mnasoni yawele natwali tuluta kikala kwa heye. Mnasomi nayali mwenyeng'haye wa Kupulo, yumwe wa walanguswa wa katali.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguluta kumlamsa Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Lotufichile Yelusalemu, wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu nawatubochela goya ng'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Mitondo yake Paoli nakaluta hamwe na hetwe kumlamsa Yakubu, wasekulu weng'ha wa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wali baho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Loyawalamse, Paoli nakawalonjela mbuli zeng'ha ziwele Nguluwi nayali yaziditile hali wanhu wa isi zinji kwa kukolela chitumagwa wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Lowahuliche ago, nawamtogola Nguluwi. Hamba wamlonjela Paoli “Kalumbu, kwangona vyokuwele na maelufu ga Wayahudi wawele nawakunda na weng'ha wanguwinza malajizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ila nawalonjelwa mbuli za hegwe kota kwanguwalangusa Wayahudi weng'ha walingikala hali wanhu isi zinji kumlema Musa na kota kwanguwalonjela waleche kuwenjiza ikumbi wana wa hewo ne kuwinza vihendo vya hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lelo mbuli zowa ndaze? Yangoneka wovizela kota hegwe mina kufika aha. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Lelo udite kota vyotulingukulonjela. Wabaha wanhu wane wawele nawelaha kuwala chinhu kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Wilumbe na hewo kuli kulanda kwa kiyeliza hamwe na hewo na ulavye sendi leka wakang'hane mnvili za hewo. Kwa nzila ayi wanhu weng'ha wovizela kota mbuli zowahuliche kuwala hegwe haziwele za kukomya na kota hegwe kwangugawinza malajizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ila kuwala wala wanhu wa isi zinji wawele nawakunda, natuwahilichila baluwa kuwalonjela mbuli zotwamule kota waleche kulya chilyo chiwele nachilavigwa nhambiko kwa jimalukolo na waleche kunwa danda na waleche kulya miwunde ja igongolo liwele halidumuligwe singo na waleche ung'hondwa.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Mitondo yake Paoli nakawahola wala wanhu, nawamlanda Nguluwi kwa kiyeliza. Hamba nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi kuwalonjela kuwala kuduma kwa mazuwa ga kiyeliza na kuwala nhambiko iwele yolavigwa kwa chiwalo cha chila yumwe wa hewo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangibatigwa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Mazuwa ago saba logawele habehi kumala, Wayahudi wawele nawalawa kuli mkowa wa Asiya nawamona Paoli kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Lelo nawambuza ivuche kwa chilundo cheng'ha cha wanhu weng'ha, nawo nawamibata. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Nawatowa iyowe wolonga, “Wanhu wa Isilaeli, mtutanze! Ayu ndo yula munhu yalinguwalangusa wanhu chila honhu mbuli za kitwanza na wanhu wa Isilaeli na kubeza malajizo ga Musa na honhu aha helile. Mzidi wa ago nakawenjiza Wagilichi kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuhadita hawe hakokomoche honhu hano helile.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Nawalonga ahyo kwa vila nawamona Tilofimo, mwenyeng'haye wa Efeso, yawele kuli muji hamwe na Paoli, nawejesa kota Paoli nakamwinjiza kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Muji weng'ha nawenela ivuche, wanhu nawoya kulawa banzi zeng'ha, nawamibata Paoli, nawambulunha, nawamlavya hanze ha ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuhinda lwizi ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nawali goya kumkopola Paoli, mbuli nazimfichila chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi wa Loma kota muji weng'ha wa Yelusalemu nawenela ivuche. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Baho du yula chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakawahola vilongozi wanji wa wamizi hamwe na wamizi, nawabilima kuluta kuli ivuche. Wala wanhu wawele nawali wodita ivuche lowamuwene yula chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi hamwe na wamizi wanguya nawaleka kumtowa Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Yula chilongozi mkulu nakamibata Paoli, nakulonga yawopigwe minyololo mili. Hamba nakawauza, “Ndo munhu wachi ayu na nakadita choni?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wamwe kuli chila chilundo cha wanhu nawatowa iyowe wolonga hino na wanji wolonga hila. Yula chilongozi loyawene kota howeza kuvizela goya kota Paoli nakadita choni kwa chiwalo cha iyowe lya wanhu, nakawalonjela wamizi wamhiliche Paoli kuli ngome ya wamizi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paoli loyafichile kuli vikwinilo, wamizi naiwagana kumpapa kwa vila nahali na ivuche likulu lya wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwa vila lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalwali lumuwinza kuno lulutilila kulonga kwa kuyowa, “Mumkopole!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangilewela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Lowawele womwinjiza mgati mwa ngome, Paoli nakamlanda chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi yolonga, “Ndoweza kukulonjela chinhu?” Yula chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakamwidichila, “Kwanguvizela kulonga kwa Chigilichi? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Hegwe huwele yula Mmisili yawele kuli mazuwa aga ga habehi nakagana kubelenhuka kwa kulongoza wehile elufu zine wawele na vinhu vya kitowela ngondo kula kugunuche?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paoli nakedichila, “Heni nda Myahudi, namhondigwa Talso ako Kilikiya, mwenyeng'haye wa muji ulinguzeleka. Dedede, ng'hundize ndidawale na wanhu wano.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Yula chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakamkundiza. Ahyo Paoli nakema mchanya mwa chikwinilo, nakawagololela moko wala wanhu leka wenyamalile, lowenyamalile, nakaluka kulongasa na hewo kwa ndonga ya Chiebulaniya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Wahaza na wang'holozangu, muhulichize ng'hatu kilewela kwa heni!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Lowahuliche yolonga na hewo kwa ndonga ya Chieblaniya nawenyamalila ng'hatu kusinda aho mwaluko. Naye Paoli nakalutilila kulonga. <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Heni nda Myahudi, namhondigwa Talso ako Kilikiya. Ila nandolelwa kuli muji awu wa Yelusalemu, hali ludali lwa Gamalieli, nandanguswa goya malajizo ga wahaza wa hetwe. Nandilavya kwa nhumbula yeng'ha kwa Nguluwi kota hemwe vyomuwele lehano. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nandiwagaza wanhu wa nzila ayi mbaka kubagama. Nandiwabata walume na wadala na kuwawika mchinweng'ho.” <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mtambika mkulu na chitala cheng'ha cha wasekulu wanguweza kulonga kuwala mbuli ayo. Kulawa kwa hewo nambochela baluwa yowandichilwe wala Wayahudi wawele ako Damasiko. Nanduta Damasiko leka ndiwabate awo wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na kuwegala kuno wawohigwe mbaka Yelusalemu leka wagazigwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulonga kuwala kuleka gehile ga heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Madito 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Lelo londiwele mnzila habehi na kufika Damasiko, nayali kota saa sita nemisi, lumuli lukulu kulawa kilanga nalulawila baho du na kulangaza kwa heni kuli banzi zeng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Aho nanyigwa hasi, nanyhulika lizi lindonjela, ‘Saulo, Saulo! Lekachoni kwangungaza?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nambuza, ‘Hegwe kwa whaani Mkulu?’ Naye nakandonjela, ‘Heni nda Yesu wa Nasaleti yawele hegwe kwangumgaza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Lelo wala wanhu wawele hamwe na heni nawalona lula lumuli ila hawahuliche lizi lya yula yawele yolongasa na heni. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nambuza, ‘Ndite choni Mkulu?’ Naye Mkulu nakandonjela, ‘Winuche, ulute Damasiko, ako kolonjelwa geng'ha goulinguganigwa kudita.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kwa vila siwezile kulola kwa chiwalo cha kupulika kwa lumuli, ahyo wayangu nawembata moko na kundongoza mbaka Damasiko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Ako nakwali na munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Ananiya, munhu yalingumdumba Nguluwi, yawele nguhulichiza malajizo ga Musa na yalinguhulichizwa ng'hatu na Wayahudi wawele wochikala ako Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Nakema habehi na heni, nakalonga, ‘Mng'holozangu Saulo! Ulole kahi.’ Baho du nambona kahi, nandimlola. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Hamba Ananiya nakalonga, ‘Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hetwe nakakuhagula leka uvizele goyalingugana na kumona yula chitumagwa wa heye yatanganiche na kuhulika ulonzi kulawa kuli mlomo wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwa vila kowa mlolezi wa heye kwa wanhu weng'ha kuwala chila chouchiwene na kuhulika. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Lelo, lekachoni kwangukawila? Winuche, ubatizigwe na kusilwa gehile ga hegwe kwa kulichema itagwa lya heye.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyhemo ya Paoli kuwadamlila wanhu wa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Lelo, nanyhiluka Yelusalemu, londiwele ndilanda kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nambona ulotezi. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Nandimona Mkulu yondonjela, ‘Hima! Wuche Yelusalemu himahima kwa vila wanhu wa hano hawokunda kulonga kwa hegwe kuwala heni.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nani nandimwidichila, ‘Mkulu, hewo wanguvizela kota heni ndo yula yawele yokola kuli masunagogi kuwebata na kuwatowa wala wawele wangukukunda. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Kahi mhela mlolezi wa hegwe Stefani loyakopoligwe, heni nandali hala, nang'hunda acho chikoleche na kwamila mikoti ja wala wawele womkopola.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Aho Mkulu nakandonjela, ‘Ulute, ndokulajiza kutali kwa wanhu wa isi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalumhulichiza Paoli mbaka loyalonjile ulonzi awo ndo nalukwiniza lizi na kutowa iyowe lulonga, “Mumkopole! Munhu kota ayu hambe yaganigwe kikala kuli isi.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Lowawele wotowa iyowe na kuvula mikoti ja hewo kuno wonimula nhimbwisi kuchanya, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakawalajiza wanhu wa heye wamhiliche Paoli kuli ngome, nakawalonjela wamzape ng'hobwa leka wavizele chambuze Wayahudi kutowa iyowe kwa chiwalo cha heye. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ila lowamuwohe leka wamzape ng'hobwa, Paoli nakamuuza chilongozi wa wamizi yawele nayali yemile aho habehi na heye, “Ndaze, yagoya kwa hemwe kwa kiwhana na malajizo kumzapa ng'hobwa mwenyeng'haye wa Lumi kung'hali kutagusigwa?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yula chilongozi wa wamizi loyahuliche ago, nakaluta kumlonjela chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi yolonga, “Kwangugana kudita choni? Munhu ayu ka mwenyeng'haye wa Loma!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Lelo, chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakaluta kwa Paoli, nakamuuza, “Ndonjele, hegwe kwa mwenyeng'haye wa Loma?” Paoli nakedichila, “Ena.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakalonga, “Heni nandiwa mwenyeng'haye wa Loma kwa kulipa chasi chikulu cha sendi.” Paoli nakalonga, “Ila heni nda mwenyeng'haye wa Loma kwa kupondigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wala wanhu wawele wewichile goya kumuuza Paoli nawoka himahima. Mbaka chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakadumba loyavizelele kota Paoli ka mwenyeng'haye wa Loma na nayali yamuwohe kwa minyololo.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguhilikwa kuli chitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Mitondo yake, chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakagana kuvizela ulonjelezi wa Wayahudi kwa Paoli. Ahyo, nakamdohola Paoli minyololo, nakawalonjela watambika wakulu na wanhu weng'ha wa chitala wadite nhing'hano. Hamba nakamigala Paoli, nakamuwika hali chitala.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paoli nakawanogolela meho wala watagusa, hamba nakaluka kulonga, “Wang'holozangu, mbaka mhela awu nanyeneza gondilinguganigwa kudita kwa Nguluwi kwa kunuwila kunojile ng'hatu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Aho Ananiya mtambika mkulu nakawalonjela wala wawele nawema habehi na Paoli kota wamzabule kumlomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Lelo, Paoli nakamlonjela, “Nguluwi yuye kokuzabula hegwe uwele kota lukanzi lubakalizwe chokaa! Kwanguweza ndaze kikala aho leka kunhagusa kwa malajizo kuno kwangubena malajizo kwa kulonga nhowigwe?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wala wanhu wawele nawema habehi na Paoli nawamlonjela, “Ndaze, kwangujeza kumliga mtambika mkulu wa Nguluwi?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paoli nakedichila, “Wang'holozangu, sivizelele kota heye ka mtambika mkulu. Kwa vila nayandichigwa, ‘Uleche kulonga vibi kuwala chilongozi wa wanhu wa hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paoli loyavizelele kota wamwe wa wanhu wawele hala nawali Masadukayo na wanji ndo Mafalisayo, nakalandula lizi hali chitala, “Wang'holozangu, heni nda Mfalisayo, mwana wa Mfalisayo. Nandonjelezwa kuwala kitumbila kwa heni kuli kuzilipuka kwa wabagame.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Loyalonjile ago, ivuche ling'ang'ale nalyaluka hali Mafalisayo na Masadukayo na nhing'hano naisambaluka. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kwa vila Masadukayo wangulonga kota kuduhu kuzilipuligwa ne haduhu wahilisi ama muhe ila Mafalisayo wangukunda aga geng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ivuche nalyonjezeka na wamwe wa walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa wawele ndo Mafalisayo nawalonga kwa mong'ho, “Hambe tone wihe woneche kwa munhu ayu, hanji muhe ama mhilisi nakalongasa na heye!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Kilewa nakwali kukulu mbaka chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakadumba kota womtema Paoli vihande vihande. Ahyo nakawalonjela wamizi wa heye walute kuli chila chilundo, wamhole Paoli na kumhilula mgati mwa ngome.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Nechilo iwinzile, mkulu nakema habehi na Paoli, nakamlonjela, “Wikangangaze nhumbula! Kota vyoulonjile hano Yelusalemu, kodita hihyo kuli muji wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wangiwika goya kumkopola Paoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Lokubwemwenzuche, Wayahudi nawadita nhing'hano ya chinyele. Nawelaha, “Hambe tulye ne kunwa mbaka hotumkopola Paoli.” <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wanhu wawele nawadita nhing'hano ayo nawapuluta makumi gane. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Lelo, nawaluta kwa watambika wakulu na wasekulu, nawalonga, “Hetwe natilaha kota hatujeza choneche kuli milomo ja hetwe mbaka hotumkopola Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Lelo hemwe hamwe na watagusa mhiliche usenga kwa chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi leka yamigale Paoli kwa hemwe, midite kota mwangugana kuvizela ng'hatu kuwala heye. Twagoya kumkopola kung'hali hanafika hano.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ila mwana wa lumbulye Paoli nakahulika kuwala kiwika goya ako, ahyo nakaluta mgati mwa ngome, nakamzelesa Paoli kuwala mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Aho Paoli kamchema mwamizi yumwe, nakamlonjela, “Mhiliche ayu msongolo kwa chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi, kana mbuli ya kumlonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mwamizi nakamhola ayo msongolo, nakamhilika mbaka kwa chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi, nakalonga, “Yula mnweng'hwa Paoli nakandanda ndimigale ayu msongolo kwa hegwe kwa vila kana mbuli ya kukulonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkulu wa wamizi nakambata ayo msongolo moko, nakamigala honhu ha uyeka, nakamuuza, “Kwangugana kundonjela choni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Heye nakalonga, “Wayahudi nawekundiza wakulande umigale Paoli kuli chitala cha hewo mitondo kwa kidita kota wangugana kuvizela goya kuwala ulonjelezi wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ila uleche kukunda kwa vila hana wanhu mzidi wa makumi gane wewichile goya kumvaba. Nawelaha kuleka kulya ne kunwa mbaka howowa wamkopole. Sambi wa goya, wangubeteza hegwe ukundize.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Chilongoza mkulu wa wamizi nakamkanya yula msongolo, “Uleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche kota nakundonjela mbuli azi.” Hamba nakamleka yalute.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguhilikwa kwa chilongozi mkulu wa mkowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Lelo, chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakawachema wamizi weli nakawalonjela, “Muwawiche goya wamizi miya mbili na wakwina falasi makumi saba na wamizi miya mbili wawele na migoha, mlute Kaisaliya, muwe goya kuka lehano kung'hali saa tatu nechilo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kahi muwiche goya falasi wamwe kwa chiwalo cha Paoli, mumhiliche kwa kikala goya kwa Felisi chilongozi wa mkowa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Hamba nakandika baluwa kuwala mbuli ayi.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Heni Klaudiyo Lusia ndangukwandichila hegwe mkulu Felisi, chilongozi wa mkowa. Ulamche! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Wayahudi nawamibata munhu ayu habehi wamkopole. Ila nanduta na vilundo vya wamizi wa heni kumlohola kwa vila nanzeleswa kota heye ka mwenyeng'haye wa Loma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nandimhilika hali chitala chikulu cha hewo kuno ndigana kuvizela kuwala ulonjelezi wa hewo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nandivizela kota ulonjelezi nawali kuwala mbuli za malajizo ga hewo, ila hawele yalonjelezwe kwa mbuli yoneche ilingumgana yabagame ama yawichigwe mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Londonjelwe kota Wayahudi nawali wewichile goya kumkopola, nanyamula kumigala kwa hegwe, nandiwalonjela wawele nawamlonjeleza walonje ulonjelezi wa hewo kwa heye hali hegwe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Lelo, awo wamizi nawamhola Paoli kota vyowalonjelwe, nawamigala nechilo yiyila mbaka Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Mitondo wamizi wa magulu nawahiluka kuli ngome, nawawaleka wala wamizi wakwina falasi walutilile na majendo hamwe na Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Lowafichile Kaisaliya nawamha chilongozi wa mkowa yila baluwa na kumuwika Paoli hali ulongozi wa heye. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felisi loyasomile ayo baluwa nakamuuza Paoli kota nakalawa kuli mkowa wachi. Loyazeleswe kota nayali yalawile kuli mkowa wa Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />nakalonga, “Ndohulichiza ulonjelezi ulingukuwala hegwe hala du wawele nawakulonjeleza howofika hano.” Hamba nakalonga Paoli yawichigwe hali wamizi kuli ng'handa ya undewa wa Helodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wangumlonjeleza Paoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Logapulute mazuwa gahano, mtambika mkulu Ananiya nakoya Kaisaliya hamwe na wasekulu wamwe na wakili yumwe yalinguchemigwa Telitulo. Nawaluta kwa chilongozi wa mkowa nawamlonjela ulonjelezi wa hewo kuwala Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paoli nakachemigwa na Telitulo nakaluka kulavya ulonjelezi yolonga, “Mkulu Felisi, ulongozi wa hegwe unojile nawigala kikala goya na mbuli nyinji zinojile nazikoleka kwa wanhu wa isi ayi kwa chiwalo cha luhala lwa hegwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Natuibochela mbuli ayi kwa usangalalo mazuwa gose na kulonga malumbo kwa hegwe chila honhu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ila ne kwajiliza mhela twangukulanda kwa isungu lya hegwe, uhulichize ulonzi wa hetwe uchefu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Natuvizela kota munhu ayu ndo mjuvi, yalingwambuza ivuche hali Wayahudi kuli isi yeng'ha, kahi ka chilongozi wa chilundo cha Wanasaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kahi nakajeza kuiliga ng'handa ya Nguluwi natwe natumibata. Natugana kumtagusa kwa malajizo ga hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ila Lusia, chilongozi mkulu wa chilundo cha wamizi, nakamhola kwa mong'ho kulawa kuli moko ga hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Hamba nakalonga walingumlonjeleza munhu ayu woye kwa hegwe. Wone komuuza hegwe koweza kuvizela mbuli azi zeng'ha zotulingumlonjeleza.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Nawo Wayahudi nawatawiza ago kwa kulonga kota ago geng'ha nagali gakukomya.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangilewela kwa Felisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Hamba Felisi chilongozi wa mkowa nakamha Paoli ulajilo yalonje. Naye Paoli nakalonga, “Ndangusangalala kilewela hali hegwe kuno ndivizela kota hegwe kwa mtagusa wa isi ayi kwa mhela wa miyaka minji. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Kwanguweza kuvizela kota hagapulute mazuwa kumi na meli kulawa hala londutile kumfugamila Nguluwi Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayahudi hawafichile ndilongasa na munhu yoneche. Hawafichile ndikwambuza ivuche kwa wanhu kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi ne kuli masunagogi ga hewo ne honhu heni honeche kuli muji awo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Hambe waweze kutawiza kwa hegwe ulonjelezi awu walingulonjeleza kuwala heni. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Chondilingukunda hali hegwe ndo achi, heni ndangumfugamila Nguluwi wa wasekulu wa hetwe, ndanguwinza nzila yila iwele hewo wanguichema haiwele nzila ya kukomya. Ndangukunda mbuli zeng'ha zandichigwe kuli vitabu vya malajizo ga waloli. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Heni ndangitumbila kwa Nguluwi nawo wanakitumbila ako kota wanhu wanojile na wehile, wozilipuka. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ahyo mazuwa gose ndangikangaza ndiwe na kunuwila kunojile hali Nguluwi na wanhu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Londikale kutali kwa miyaka minji, nanyiluka Yelusalemu leka ndiwatanze wanhu wa isi ya heni wawele wazunwa na kulavya nhambiko. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mhela londiwele ndidita ago ndo nawafika heni kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi ndiwele mana nyelizwa. Nakwali haduhu chilundo cha wanhu ne ivuche. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ila nakwali na Wayahudi wamwe kulawa kuli mkowa wa Asiya, awo ndo nawaganigwa wawe hano hali hegwe na kulavya ulonjelezi wa hewo wone wana choneche cha kulonga kuwala heni. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ama, wanhu awa wawele hano walonje ndo wihe wachi wauwene kwa heni mhela lowanyimize hali chitala cha hewo chikulu, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila wowa ulonzi awu wondonjile lonyimile hali hewo, ‘Mwangunhagusa lehano kwa chiwalo cha kibatilila kota wabagame wozilipuka!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Aho, Felisi, yawele nayali yoizela goya nzila yila, nakalonga, “Ndolavya utaguso wa nongwa ayi mhela Lusia, chilongozi mkulu wa chilundo cha wamizi, hoyokuya aha.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Hamba nakamlonjela chilongozi wa wamizi yamuwiche Paoli hali wamizi, ila yawe na kilejeha hado na goloko wa heye waleche kulemezwa kumha choyalinguganigwa kupegwa kwa chiwalo cha heye.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulongasa na Felisi na Dulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Logamalile mazuwa mado, Felisi nakoya hamwe na mche wa heye yalinguchemigwa Dilusila yawele nayali Myahudi. Nakalajiza Paoli yegaligwe, nakamhulichiza yolonga kuwala kumkunda Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ila mhela Paoli loyaluche kulonga kuwala kutanganika na kuwala kuwa na chasi cha kudita chinhu na kuwala zuwa lya utaguso lilinguya, Felisi nakadumba, nakalonga, “Sambi kwanguweza kuluta, ndokuchema kahi hondilejeha.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Mhela awo Felisi nayali yochitumbila kota kopegwa chinhu kwa chinyele na Paoli. Kwa chiwalo acho nayali yomchema Paoli chila mhela na kulongasa na heye.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Lojimalile miyaka mili, Polikio Festo nakahola honhu ha Felisi, nakawa chilongozi wa mkowa. Kwa vila nakagana kuganigwa na Wayahudi, Felisi nakamleka Paoli kukula mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulanda kulonjelezwa kwa heye kulute kwa chilongozi mkulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festo loyafichile kuli mkowa wa Kaisaliya nakekala kwa mazuwa gadatu hamba nakaluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Watambika wakulu hamwe na vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawamlonjela Festo kuwala ulonjelezi ulingumuwala Paoli. Nawamdedeza Festo <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />yawaditile igano kwa kumigala Paoli Yelusalemu, nawali wewichile goya kwa uviso kota wamkopole hoyowa mnzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ila Festo nakalonga, “Paoli kosigala mchinweng'ho kula Kaisaliya nani ndoluta ako kuli mazuwa gaga. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Wamwe wa vilongozi wa hemwe walute ako hamwe na heni wakalavye ulonjelezi kuwala heye wone nakadita choneche chihile.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo nekekala na hewo kwa mhela wa mazuwa nane ama kumi hino, hamba nakahiluka Kaisaliya. Mitondo yake nakaluta kuli chitala, nakalajiza Paoli yegaligwe mng'handa. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Mhela Paoli loyafichile, Wayahudi wawele nawalawa Yelusalemu nawamzunguluta na kwaluka kulavya ulonjelezi winji uwele hawawezile kutawiza. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kwa kilewela, Paoli nakalonga, “Siditile nongwa yoneche ilinguwala malajizo ga Wayahudi ne kuwala ng'handa ya Nguluwi, ne kumuwala Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festo nakagana kulajila igano kwa Wayahudi ahyo nakamuuza Paoli, “Ndaze kwangugana kuluta Yelusalemu na utagusigwe ako hali heni kwa chiwalo cha ulonjelezi awu?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paoli nakedichila, “Ndangwima hali chitala cha Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma, hano ndo ndanguganigwa kutagusigwa. Kota vyoulinguvizela goya, siwaditile Wayahudi wihe woneche. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Lelo, wone nafichigwa na nongwa ilingungana ngazigwe mbaka kubagama, hambe ndande kulechelwa kugazigwa ako. Ila wone ulonjelezi wa hewo hauwele wa kukomya, haduhu yalinguweza kumbika kuli moko ga hewo. Ndangulanda ulonjelezi awu uhilikwe kwa Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Lelo, Festo loyalongase na wakulu wa chitala, nakamlonjela Paoli, “Kulanda ulonjelezi wa hegwe uhilikwe kwa Kaizali, lelo koluta kwa Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festo kangumlonjela Agilipa mbuli za Paoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mazuwa mado hamba, mndewa Agilipa na Belinike nawafika Kaisaliya leka kumlamsa Festo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nawali ako mazuwa kwa menji naye Festo nakamlonjela mndewa ulonjelezi wa Paoli, “Hana munhu yumwe hano yawele Felisi nakamleka mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Londutile Yelusalemu watambika wakulu na wasekulu wa Wayahudi nawamlonjeleza kwa heni na kundanda ndimtaguse. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ila heni nandiwalonjela kota hachiwele chihendo cha Waloma kumlavya munhu yagazigwe kung'hali yawele yalonjelezwe hanating'hana na walingumlonjeleza na kulonjelwa yelewele kuwala awo ulonjelezi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Lelo, lowafichile hano sikawile, ila nandita nhing'hano kuli chitala mitondo yake, nandajiza munhu ayo yegaligwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Walonjelezi wa heye nawema ila hawalavile ulonjelezi wihile kota vyondili ndijesa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ila nawali wochitwanza na heye kuwala nzila ya makundo ga hewo na kuwala munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Yesu yawele nakabagama, ila Paoli kangulonga kota ka mkomu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Sivizelele kota ndite ndaze kuwala kulavya utaguso wa mbuli ayo. Lelo, nandimuuza Paoli wone kogana kuluta kuli chitala kula Yelusalemu kwa chiwalo cha ulonjelezi awo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ila Paoli nakalema, nakalanda yasigale mchinweng'ho mbaka londiweza kumhilika kwa Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Hamba mndewa Agilipa nakamlonjela Festo, “Nangana kumuhulika munhu ayo nene baha.” Festo nakamlonjela, “Komuhulika mitondo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli hali mndewa Agilipa na Belinike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Mitondo, mndewa Agilipa na Belinike nawafika kwa usangalalo kuli chitala wawele welongoze na wakulu wa wamizi na vilongozi wa muji. Festo nakalajiza Paoli yegaligwe, <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />hamba Festo nakalonga, “Mndewa Agilipa na weng'ha muwele hano hamwe na hetwe! Hano kumwando kwa hemwe hana munhu yawele Wayahudi weng'ha wa hano na wa kula Yelusalemu nawang'ung'uta kwa kutowa iyowe kota hambe yaganigwe kikala. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ila heni siwene kota nayali yaditile choneche chihile mbaka yaganigwe kutagusigwa yagazigwe mbaka kubagama. Ila kwa vila Paoli yuye nakalanda ulonjelezi wa heye uhilichigwe kwa Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma, nanyamula kumigala. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Kwa heni ndahela mbuli yenele iwele yondita mbeze kumwandichila Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma kuwala heye. Ahyo nandimigala kwa hemwe na hali hegwe mndewa Agilipa, leka hotumhulichiza goya, ndoweza kuwa na lya kukwandichila. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwa vila kwahela chiwalo cha kumigala mnweng'hwa ne kuwa ulonjelezi ulingumuwala.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kangilewela hali mndewa Aglipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Hamba mndewa Agilipa nakamlonjela Paoli, “Kwangukundizwa kilewela.” Aho Paoli nakagolola moko wa heye nakelewela hino, <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Mndewa Agilipa, ndangiwona kota nhambichizwa kwa kilewela hali hegwe kuwala ulonjelezi weng'ha uwele Wayahudi nawali walonjile kuwala heni. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kwa vila hegwe kwanguvizela vihendo vya Wayahudi na kitwanza kwa hewo, ndangulanda unyhulichize kwa kwimilila.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayahudi weng'ha wanguvizela kikala kwa heni kulawila kuli uwana wa heni, ndaze vyondikale kulawila mwaluko kuli kikala kwa heni kuli isi ya heni na ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wangunzela kwa mhela winji na wanguweza kulonga wone wogana, kota kulawila mwaluko nandikala kota yumwe wa chilundo cha walinguikunda ng'hatu nzila ya hetwe ya kufugamila, mina ndo chilundo cha Mafalisayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Sambi nda hano nhagusigwe kwa chiwalo ndangitumbila lila ilagano liwele Nguluwi nakalagana na wasekulu wa hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ali ndo ilagano liwele nhanzi kumi na mbili za isi ya hetwe zangugana kulyona likwenela hozimkolela mijito Nguluwi kwa nhumbula yeng'ha nemisi na nechilo. Mng'hangala mndewa, Wayahudi wangundonjeleza kwa chiwalo cha kitumbila ako! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Lekachoni hemwe mwangona itunyo ng'hatu kukunda kota Nguluwi kanguwazilipula wabagame? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Ndikomya, nani nang'hunda kota nanganigwa kudita mbuli nyinji leka kulilema itagwa lya Yesu wa Nasaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mbuli azo ndo zondiziditile ako Yelusalemu. Kwa ludali lwa watambika wakulu watambika wakulu, nandiwawika mchinweng'ho wanhu wenji hali welile. Lowatagusigwe kubagama nang'hunda mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mala nyinji nandiwadita wagazigwe kuli masunagogi geng'ha kuno ndiwadita waileme nzila ya hewo ya kufugamila. Ng'halazi ya heni kwa hewo nayali ng'hulu mbaka nandiwapala kuli miji ja kutali.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulonga vyoyalohoche</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Madito 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Lelo, kuli mijito ajo londiwele ndiluta Damasiko kuno mbele na ludali kulawa kwa watambika wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Lombele mnzila mhela wa nemisi, nambona lumuli lukulu kusinda lumuli lwa isanya, nalulangaza kulawa kilanga, nalunzunguluta heni hamwe na wala wawele mmajendo na heni. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Tweng'ha natugwa hasi, nani nanyhulika lizi lindonjela kwa Chieblaniya, ‘Saulo, Saulo! Lekachoni kwangungaza? Kwangilumiza hihi hela kota isenga lilingutowa teche ng'hweku ya mkulu wa heye.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Heni nambuza, ‘Kwa whaani hegwe Mkulu?’ Naye Mkulu nakedichila, ‘Heni nda Yesu yawele hegwe ulingumgaza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Winuche lelo, wime. Nandikulawila leka ndikudite uwe chitumagwa na mlolezi wa heni. Kotawiza kwa wanhu wanji mbuli zouzonile lehano na zila zondikulajila. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ndokulohola kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli na wanhu wa isi zinji wawele nandikulajiza kwa hewo. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Kogubula meho ga hewo na kuwadita walawe kuli jiza na kwinjila kuli lumuli, walawe kuli ulongozi wa Limazoga, wamgalamchile Nguluwi, leka kwa kukunda, woselwe gehile na kuhola honhu ha hewo hali wala wanhu wahaguligwe Nguluwi.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangulonga kuwala mijito ja heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Mndewa Agilipa, siwezile kuwa mjuvi kwa ulajilo awo wa kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ila nanyaluka kudamla kwa wanhu wa Damasiko, hamba kwa wala wa Yelusalemu na isi yeng'ha ya Yudeya, kahi na wanhu wa isi zinji. Nandiwalonjela wamgalamchila Nguluwi na kulajila kwa madito kota nhumbula za hewo nazigaluka. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwa chiwalo acho, Wayahudi newembata lombele kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nawajeza kung'hopola. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ila Nguluwi nakanhanza, ahyo mbaka lehano nanyima nzinzili kuno ndilavya ulolezi kwa weng'ha, wakulu na wadodo. Gondilingulonga ndo gala waloli na Musa nawalonga kota golawila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Nawalonga kota naigana Kilistu yagaziche na yawe wa mwaluko kuzilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame, leka yawikule kota lumuli lwa ulohozi lwanguwalangazila wanhu weng'ha, Wayahudi kahi na wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paoli loyawele yelewele kwa kulonga ago, Festo nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Paoli! Kuna lukwale! Kusoma lukami kwa hegwe kwangukudita uwe na lukwale!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ila Paoli nakalonga, “Mndewa Festo, ndahela lukwale chondilingulonga ndo kukomya ng'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Hegwe mndewa Agilipa kwanguzizela mbuli azi, ahyo ndanguweza kulonga ne kudumba hali hegwe. Ndahela majesa kwa vila mbuli azi zanguzeleka kwa hegwe kwa vila hazikoleche chinyele. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mndewa Agilipa, ndaze, kuna makundo na waloli? Ndanguvizela kota kwangukunda.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Mndewa Agilipa nakamlonjela Paoli “Ndaze, kwangundita ndimkunde Kilistu himahima hino!” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paoli nakedichila, “Ndangumlanda Nguluwi kota, kwa mhela udo ama winji, haiwele hegwe hela ila weng'ha walingunyhulika lehano wawe kota heni, ila ne minyololo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Aho mndewa Agilipa na chilongozi wa mkowa na Belinike na wala weng'ha wawele wekalise hamwe na hewo nawema. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Lowawele wokuka nawalongasa, “Munhu ayu haditile choneche chilingumuwala kubagama ama chinweng'ho.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Mndewa Agilipa nakamlonjela Festo, “Munhu ayu yahalechigwe yelejehe wone yahalechile kulanda nongwa ya heye ihulichizwe na Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paoli kanguluta Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Lowamule kota twaluche majendo mbaka Italiya, nawamuwika Paoli hamwe na wanweng'ha wanji hali wamizi wa Yulio yawele nayali chilongozi wa chilundo chilinguchemigwa “Chilundo cha wamizi wa Kaizali Agusto.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Natukwina meli iwele nailawa Adilamito iwele goya kuluta kuli bandali za mkowa wa Asiya, natwaluka majendo. Alistako mwenyeng'haye wa Makedoniya, kulawa Tesalonike kulawila Tesalonike, nayali hamwe na hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Mitondo yake natufika kuli bandali ya Sidoni. Yulio nakamditila Paoli ganojile kwa kumkundiza yawone goloko wa heye leka yapegwe vinhu kwa chiwalo cha heye. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kulawa ako natulutilila na majendo, ila kwa vila mbeho nayali iputa lukami ikuya kumwando kwa hetwe, natukola nzingo ya chihilwa cha Kupilo kuwele mbeho nayali nyindo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Hamba natuloka bahali ya Kilikiya na Pamfiliya, natufika Mula, muji wa Lukiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ayo yula mkulu wa wamizi nakaifika meli imwe ya Alekizandiliya ilinguluta Italiya, nakatukwiniza amo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Natujenda mholemhole kwa mhela wa mazuwa menji, kwa kugaya natufika habehi na Nido. Kwa vila mbeho nayali ing'hali iputa, natulutilila kumwando natukolela ubanzi wa Kilete habehi na Salimoni kuwele mbeho hayali nyinji. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Natukola mfungo mholemhole natufika honhu halinguchemigwa Bandali Inojile, habehi na muji wa Laseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Mhela winji nawali ukolile, mbaka zuwa lya kwesela kulya nalyali likolile. Lelo haiwele goya kulutilila na majendo kwa meli. Lelo Paoli nakawakanya, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Wang'hangala, ndangijesa kota majendo aga gowa na magazo na kwajiliza vinhu lukami haiwele kwa vinhu viwele kuli meli yeka mbaka kwa ukomu wa hetwe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ila yula mng'hangala nakagahulichiza ng'hatu na goyalonjile yalingwendesa meli kusinda gala goyalonjile Paoli. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwa vila bandali ayo haiwele honhu hanojile ha kikala mhela wa chipute, wenji nawagana kulutilila na majendo mbaka Foinike. Foinike ndo bandali ya Kilete iwele kusini mbaka kolizinjilaga na kasikazini mbaka kolizinjilaga isanya, ako wahawezile kikala kuli mhela wa chipute.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbeho ng'hulu kuli bahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Lelo nailawila mbeho inojile ya kusi nayaluka kuputa, nawo nawejesa kota gowalingujesa nagali goya, ahyo nawaluka majendo, nawendesa meli habehi ng'hatu na mhwani ya Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ila haupulute mhela winji, mbeho ng'hulu ya kasikazini nayaluka kuputa kulawila kuli chihilwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mbeho naitowa kuli yila meli na kwa vila natulemwa kitwanza na yila mbeho, ahyo naituhilula kuli bahali kuwele mbeho nayali iluta. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Chihilwa chimwe chilinguchemigwa Kauda nachitudinya hado na ayo mbeho, lotukolile kusini mwa chihilwa acho natusinda hanga kwa kugaya kuidita meli yime. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Walingudaha kojelela nawalikwega itumbwi mbaka mgati mwa meli hamba nawaliwoha ng'hatu kwa ng'weso. Nawadumba kota wahahilichigwe kuli misanga habehi na mhwani ya Siliti. Ahyo nawadulisa matanga na kuileka meli ihilichigwe na mbeho. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mbeho nailutilila kuputa na mitondo yake nawaluka kutoza kuli mazi mhomholo kulawa kuli meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Zuwa lya kadatu, nawaluka kutoza kuli mazi vinhu vimwe vya kuli meli kwa moko ga hewo wawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa mhela wa mazuwa menji hatuwezile kona isanya ne nhondwe, mbeho nailutilila kuputa ng'hatu, mbaka kitumbila kota tolohoka nakutumala.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Lotikale kwa mazuwa menji ne kulya chilyo, Paoli nakema hali hewo, nakalonga, “Wang'holozangu, yahawele goya wone namnyhulichize na kuleka kwinula majendo kulawa Kilete. Wone namdite ahyo hatwalifichigwa na magazo aga na kwajiliza vinhu avi vyeng'ha. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ila sambi ndangukulanda kota mikangaze nhumbula, haduhu ne yumwe wa hemwe yawele kokwajiliza ukomu wa heye, meli yeka ndo yodumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kwa vila zuwa likolile nayali nechilo, mhilisi wa Nguluwi yawele heni ndo wa heye na yawele ndangumfugamila nakandawila, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />nakandonjela, ‘Paoli, uleche kudumba kwa vila yangukugana wime hali Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma, naye Nguluwi kwa isungu lyake nakakupa uganililo wa ukomu na weng'ha wawele kuli majendo hamwe na hegwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ahyo wang'holozangu, mikangaze nhumbula! Kwa vila ndangumkunda Nguluwi kota yowa hihila kota vyondonjelwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ila yotugana kutajigwa hafungo ha chihilwa chimwenga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Nechilo ya zuwa lya kumi na nne, natwali tuhilikwa aku na hako kuli bahali ya Mediteleniyani. Behi na nechilo ng'hatu, walingudaha kojelela nawejesa kota wahabehi na isi ng'havu. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Aho nawapima winji wa mazi kulutila hasi kwa kudulisa ng'weso iwele naiwohigwa chinhu chiwele na itunyo likulu, nawapata mita makumi gane. Hamba nawalutilila kumwando hado nawapima kahi nawapata mita makumi gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwa kudumba kunhanhahila kuli mitalawe, nawadulisa vinhu vine vya kwimiza meli kumbele mwa meli, nawalanda kubwemwenzuche himahima. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Walingudaha kojelela nawagana wache chinyele, kwa vila nawalidulisa itumbwi kuli mazi, nawedita kota wanguluta kudulisa vinhu vya kwimiza meli viwele kumwando kwa meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ila Paoli nakamlonjela yula chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi na wamizi wa heye, “Wone awa walingudaha kojelela hawosigala kuli meli, hamlohoka.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Aho wala wamizi nawazitema zila ng'weso zibatilile lila itumbwi, walileka liholigwe na mazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Habehi na kubwemwenzuka, Paoli nakawadedeza weng'ha walye chilyo, “Kwa mazuwa kumi na gane namwali kuli kudumba ne kulya, hamdile chinhu choneche. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Lelo, ndanguwadedeza mulye chilyo leka mlutilile kikala. Kwa vila ne mnvili yimwe kuli vitwi vya hemwe haikwajilila.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Loyalonjile ago, Paoli kahola ibumunda, nakalonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi hali hewo weng'ha, nakalibena, nakaluka kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Aho weng'ha nawekangaza nhumbula, nawo nawalya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tweng'ha natwali wanhu miya mbili makumi saba na sita kuli meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Chila munhu loyadile chilyo cha kuhega, nawapunguza itunyo lya meli kwa kutaga nyhule kuli bahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meli yangubeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Lokubwemwenzuche, walingudaha kojelela nawalemwa kuizela yila isi, ila nawachona chihilwa chiwele na misanga, walamula kwimiza meli ako wone yahawele goya. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ahyo nawadumula nanga na kuzileka mbahali, mhela wuwo nawadohola ng'weso ziwele naziwohigwa kuli chilongoza meli, hamba nawawoha igolole kumwando kwa meli leka libate mbeho, nawaluta kuli chihilwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ila nawafika honhu hawele bahali mbili naziting'hana, meli inanahila. Honhu ha kumwando ha meli nayinjila mmisanga ne kutigasika. Honhu ha kumbele kwa meli nakwaluka kubeneka vihande vihande kwa kutowigwa na nhigu ziwele na mong'ho.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wamizi nawagana kuwakopola wanweng'ha weng'ha kwa kudumba kota wahahojelele mbaka mwhani na kusulupuka. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ila kwa vila yula mkulu wa wamizi nakagana kumlohola Paoli, nakawalemeza waleche kudita ahyo. Nakawalonjela wala wadahile kojelela wanyozoche kulawa kuli meli na kojelela mbaka mhwani, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na wanji wawinze kwa kibatilila kuli mbawo ama kuli vihande vya meli ibeneche. Ahyo ndo tweng'ha vyotufichile wakomu kuli mhwani.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Gamfichile Paoli ako kuli chihilwa cha Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Lotufichile kwa kikala goya kuli isi ng'havu, natuvizela kota chila chihilwa changuchemigwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wenyeng'haye wa aho nawali wanojile kwa hetwe. Nhonya nayaluka kutowa kahi nakwali na chipute, ahyo nawabwina chiluli, nawatuchema. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paoli nakalokota mpelo udodo wa ngodi nayali yoziwika kuli chiluli. Ahyo kwachiwalo cha ivuche lya chiluli, izoka nalilawa kuli ngodi na kumnanahila Paoli mmoko. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wenyeng'haye wa hala lowaliwene lila izoka lininila kuli moko wa heye nawelonjela, “Ne majesa munhu ayu mana kakopola munhu, hanga nakalohoka kudumigwa mbahali, hachi haimlechele yalutilile kikala!” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ila Paoli nakalimizila lila izoka kuli chiluli, halumizwe nehado. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wala wanhu wawele wololela kota yahatung'hune ama yahagwile na kubagama baho du. Lowabeteze kwa mhela uhejile ne kona chinhu choneche chimfichile Paoli, nawagalamla majesa gawo kuwala heye, nawalonga kota heye ka mlungu.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Habehi na honhu hala nahali na mgunda ukulu wa Pubilio, chilongozi wa chila chihilwa. Pubilio nakatuchema kota goloko wa heye, natwali wajenzi wa heye kwa mazuwa gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Lelo, mhaza wa Pubilio nayali yawasile mchinhanda yotamika lupanzo. Paoli nakaluta kumlola na lowalandile kwa Nguluwi, nakawika moko ga heye kwa mtamwa, nakamusila utamwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Kwa mbuli ayo, watamwa weng'ha hali chila chihilwa nawoya, nawo nawoselwa matamwa gawo. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Wanhu nawatupa ndolendole nyinji na mhela lotwaluche kahi majendo, nawajela mgati mwa meli vinhu vyotulingugana tuwe navyo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majendo kulawa Malita kuluta Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Lojipulute myezi jidatu natwaluka kahi majendo kwa meli imwe ya Alekizandiliya ilinguchemigwa “Milungu Minyambili.” Meli ayo nayali yimile kuli chihilwa kwa mhela weng'ha wa chipute. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Natufika kuli muji wa Silakusa, natikala ako kwa mazuwa gadatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Hamba natwinula majendo, natufika Legio. Lolipulute zuwa limwe, mbeho nayaluka kuputa kulawila kusini, mazuwa meli hamba natufika kuli muji wa Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ako natuwafika wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, natuwalanda tikale na hewo kwa mhela wa juma limwe. Ahyo ndo natulutilila na majendo mbaka Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu wa kula Loma, lowalonjelwe mbuli za hetwe, nawoya kutubochela kuli honhu ha kuguzila na kugula vinhu lya Apiyo na honhu halinguchemigwa Ng'handa zidatu za kwesela na kuwasa wajenzi. Paoli loyawawene nakalonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi, nakekangaza nhumbula.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangudamla kuli muji wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Lotufichile Loma Paoli nakakundizwa kikala yaliyeng'ha hamwe na mwamizi yumwe wa kumwamila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Mazuwa gadatu hamba, Paoli nakawachema vilongozi wa Chiyahudi wa honhu aho. Loweting'hane, Paoli kawalonjela, “Wang'holozangu, hanga siditile chinhu choneche chihile ne kubeza chihendo cha wasekulu wa hetwe, nandibatigwa kula Yelusalemu na kuwichigwa kuli moko ga Waloma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Waloma lowambuzile na kona kota ndahela nongwa yoneche, nawagana kundechela, <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />ila Wayahudi wanji nawailema mbuli ayo, ahyo naingana kukana lufaa kwa Kaizali mndewa mkulu wa Loma, hanga siwele na choneche cha kuwatagusa wang'holozangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Kwa chiwalo acho nandanda kiwona na kudawala na hemwe, nanyowigwa minyololo aji kwa chiwalo cha kitumbila kwa Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Hewo nawamlonjela, “Hetwe hatunabochela baluwa yoneche kulawa Yudeya, ne haduhu mng'holozetu yoneche yafichile hano na kulavya mbuli ama kulonga choneche chihile kuwala hegwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ila twangijesa kota yagoya tuhuliche kulawa kwa hegwe mbuli ziwele kumutwi kwa hegwe. Kwa vila twanguvizela kota acho chilundo cha hegwe changulemigwa chila honhu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Hamba walonga na heye zuwa lya kuting'hana, na wenji nawafika ako koyawele ngikala. Kulawila lufuka mbaka matinazo Paoli nakawagubulila kuwala Undewa wa Nguluwi, kuno yojeza kuwadita wakunde mbuli kuwala Yesu kwa kukolela malajizo ga Musa na maandiko ga waloli. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wanhu wamwe nawakunda ulonzi wa heye, ila wamwe hawakundile. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Lelo nakwali na kibagula kuli majesa ga hewo. Lowawele woluta, Paoli nakalonga mbuli ayi, “Ndikomya ga goya gala Muhe Yelile goyawalonjele wasekulu wa hemwe kwa kukolela mloli Isaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“ ‘Ulute kwa wanhu awa ukawalonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kuhulika mohulika, ila hamvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kulola molola, ila hamkona.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kwa vila nyhala za wanhu awa nazizilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nawadinya makutu gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nawadinya meho gawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Hanji, wahalolile kwa meho gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">wahahuliche kwa makutu gawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Wahavizelele kwa nyhala zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kungaluchila, kangulonga Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nani ndahawalohole.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Hamba Paoli nakalonga, “Lelo mvizele, usenga wa Nguluwi kuwala ulohozi nauhilikwa kwa wanhu wa isi zinji. Hewo wohulichiza.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paoli loyalonjile ago, Wayahudi nawoka kuno wochitwanza lukami hewo kwa hewo.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa mhela wa miyaka mili Paoli nakekala kuli ng'handa iwele nakailipila sendi yuye, nayali yowabochela weng'ha wawele nawoya kumlamsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nayali yodamla Undewa wa Nguluwi na kulangusa kuwala Mkulu Yesu Kilistu ne kudumba na kulemezwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>